{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"A Shinigami is Born!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-05\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo Kurosaki, a teenage boy who can see ghosts, helps a young girl ghost when some skateboarders knock over a vase offering for her. The next day Ichigo sees the young girl being chased by a big monster called a Hollow. Ichigo goes to help the girl but when the girl is just about to be eaten, a female Soul Reaper, Rukia Kuchiki, appears and saves them. That night Rukia visits Ichigo’s room and is surprised when she realizes she is visible to him. While they are conversing a Hollow appears and terorizes Ichigo’s family and household. After receiving a terrible injury from the Hollow, Rukia makes a final attempt to save her life, as well as that of the Kurosaki family and transfers her powers to Ichigo so he can save his family.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155071/screencap/63bb5a37e5344.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"死神になっちゃった日\"},{\"title\":\"Pay or Play\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-12\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"After the previous night's attack, Ichigo decides to check up on his family and finds that they do not remember anything that happened. In school, Ichigo meets the Soul Reaper from the night before, Rukia Kuchiki; she is posing as an exchange student until her powers return. Rukia tells Ichigo that he must take her place as a Soul Reaper for now. Later when attacking a Hollow, Ichigo recognizes the Hollow as Orihime Inoue’s older brother.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155072/screencap/63bb5a688e7b1.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"死神のお仕事\"},{\"title\":\"Sibling Rivalry\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-19\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Orihime and her friend Tasuki are being attacked by a Hollow who was once Orihime's brother. Ichigo shows up and begins fighting with him. Orihime's brother is also struggling to gain control. Orihime is almost killed but her soul remains attached to her chain. Finally Orihime's brother gains control long enough to say one last goodbye to his sister before Ichigo sends his soul off to the Soul Society.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155073/screencap/63bb5a9e8add6.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"兄の想い, 妹の想い\"},{\"title\":\"And Your Bird Can Speak\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-26\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Chad, Ichigo's classmate and friend, is given a cursed cockatiel. He brings the bird to school, along with a plethora of injuries to his large body. Sensing spirit energy in the bird, Rukia feels they need to perform a Konso on the cockatiel and help its soul pass on. That evening, an injured Chad is brought to Kurosaki Clinic. Ichigo and Rukia sense the presence of a dangerous Hollow emanating from Chad's wound. The following morning, Chad bolts from his hospital bed and is nowhere to be found.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155074/screencap/63bb5b0a87246.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"呪いのインコ\"},{\"title\":\"Beat the Invisible Enemy!\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-02\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia and Chad are fighting the Hollow who was hunting the young boy's soul. Chad cannot see the Hollow but he can sense it and attacks it. Rukia can see the Hollow, but since she still has none of her Soul Reaper powers her attacks have no effect. A little while into the fight Ichigo appears and starts fighting the Hollow. When Ichigo defeats this Hollow it is sent to Hell and not the Soul Society because the soul slayer can only cleanse sins after death not ones during life.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155075/screencap/63bb5b3b3b98d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"見えない敵を殴れ!\"},{\"title\":\"Fight to the Death! Ichigo vs. Ichigo\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-09\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia purchases a temporary soul at Urahara’s store for Ichigo to use when she is not around and he needs to fight a Hollow. What Rukia does not realize is that what she purchased isn’t a normal temporary soul; it is a modified soul with special powers created by the Soul Society. When this modified soul takes Ichigo’s place it decides to have a little fun in Ichigo’s body and refuses to give it back to Ichigo.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155076/screencap/63bb5f3d8c760.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"死闘! 一護VS イチゴ\"},{\"title\":\"Greetings from a Stuffed Toy\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-16\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"While Ichigo is fighting with the modified soul Rukia gets a message on her spirit phone about a nearby Hollow. Ichigo and the mod soul then defeat the Hollow together. Shortly after this happens Urahara removes the mod soul from Ichigo’s body. Instead of getting the mod soul destroyed Ichigo places it in a stuffed animal and gives it the name Kon.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155077/screencap/63bb5f509775a.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ぬいぐるみからコンにちは\"},{\"title\":\"June 17, a Memory of Rain\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-23\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"On the anniversary of his mother’s death Ichigo and his family visit her grave. While he is there Ichigo remembers the day his mother died. Rukia is found by a Shinigami who asks her why she hasn’t returned to the soul society. Ichigo accidentally tells him that he is her substitute Shinigami; which happens to be a felony. Meanwhile Ichigo’s sisters are being attacked by a Hollow.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155078/screencap/63bb5f7269e70.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"6月17日, 雨の記憶\"},{\"title\":\"Unbeatable Enemy\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2004-11-30\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo finds out that the Hollow attacking his sisters is the same Hollow that killed his mother 5 years earlier. This Hollow is called the Grandfisher and has evaded the Shinigami for over 50 years. Because of the fact that this Hollow killed his mother to defend his pride Ichigo must fight it alone.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155079/screencap/63bb5f8f026b8.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"倒せない敵\"},{\"title\":\"Assault on Trip at Sacred Ground!\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-07\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Don Kan’onji, the star of a show that specializes in spirit exorcism, comes to Ichigo’s town to do a live show. Kan’onji thinks he is exorcising an earth bound spirit but instead he turns it in to a Hollow. Now he must rely on Ichigo help to defeat it.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155080/screencap/63bb5fbf0b411.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ぶらり霊場突撃の旅!\"},{\"title\":\"The Legendary Quincy\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-14\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia gets a message on her pager about a nearby Hollow. When Rukia and Ichigo arrive at the place the where Hollow was supposed to be they find out that it had already been defeated. This happens once again but this time shortly afterwards a man who calls himself a Qunicy confronts them. Rukia goes to the Urahara shop to learn more about what a Qunicy is. She learns that a Qunicy is a person that kills Hollows. But the way a Qunicy defeats a Hollow is different; they totally destroy a Hollow while a Shinigami only \\\"cleanses\\\" its soul.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155081/screencap/63bb5fdc3227c.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"伝説のクインシー\"},{\"title\":\"A Gentle Right Arm\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-21\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Uuryu and Ichigo have a contest to see who can destroy the most Hollows after Uuryu releases his Hollow bait. Meanwhile Chad is being pursued by a Hollow because he has spiritual powers. He runs into Ichigo’s sister Karen and must protect her and her friends from the Hollow with his powerful right arm.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155082/screencap/63bb6003225fc.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"やさしい右腕\"},{\"title\":\"Flower and Hollow\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2004-12-28\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Orihime and her friends are being attacked by a hollow who can shoot seeds that control people from its head. Orihime realizes that she has a spiritual power where she can control six small fairy like beings. She uses this power to defeat the hollow.  Later Orihime and Chad are taken to Urahara Kisuke's store where they are told about Shinigami and Hollows. Meanwhile Uuryu is starting to believe that something larger is going on because his Hollow bait shouldn't have attracted so many Hollows.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155083/screencap/63bb603e0b02e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"花とホロウ\"},{\"title\":\"Back to Back, A Fight to the Death!\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-11\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia tells Ichigo why the Shinigami defeated the Quincy 200 years earlier. Ichigo confronts Uuryu with this knowledge while they are fighting the Hollows. This makes Uuryu remember how his Sensei died. While reminiscing Ichigo and Uuryu notice they are surrounded by Hollows and must work together to defeat them. While they are fighting Urahara and his friends show up and defeat the Hollows. Now Ichigo and Uuryu can concentrate on the Menos, a gigantic Hollow formed from hundreds of Hollows, which just appeared in the sky. \\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155084/screencap/63bb605c83a43.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"背中合わせの死闘!\"},{\"title\":\"Kon`s Great Plan\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-18\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Kon's on a mission. And this mission involves getting love from the ladies. Too bad for this stuffed lion, as everything he hopes for gets flipped upside down and around. Also, Urahara gets a strange visit from an even stranger black cat. One that knows him well enough to see through his faux attitude.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155085/screencap/63bb606b90049.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"コンのウハウハ大作戦\"},{\"title\":\"Encounter: Abarai Renji!\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2005-01-25\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The feelings Rukia have been experiencing of late drive her to run away. But she doesn't get far, as two familiar Shinigami come forth to claim her. Lucky for her the Quincy, Ishida Uryuu, was about the night-covered streets. And lucky for her Ichigo arrives. But Rukia's luck can only take her so far.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155086/screencap/63bb60b5443ef.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"阿散井恋次, 見参!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Dies!\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-01\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo continues his duel with Renji. He has underestimated this Shinigami one too many times. When overwhelmed he is driven into a corner. And as the killing blow is about to be met, the calm Byakuya steps in. Only problem is... he's too swift for you to notice before you're impaled.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155087/screencap/63bb60c2478f1.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"一護, 死す!\"},{\"title\":\"Reclaim! The Power of the Shinigami\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-08\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"With Rukia's leaving, everyone's memory seems to have vanished as well. Only those who will be key players later have been able to remember. Ichigo needs training and luckily with school out, Urahara Kisuke will put him through some hardships.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155088/screencap/63bb60e05d900.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"取り戻せ! 死神の力!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Becomes a Hollow!\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-15\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo trains with Urahara. He is underground trapped in the hole with 72 hours left until his life chain will come to its end. Held by a binding spell, he waits while Jinta and Ururu tease him. When his chain is no more, he goes though the process of becoming a Hollow. In his mind Ichigo finds that he has to find the shinigami box or he will become a Hollow. After he finds the box he comes out of the hole a semi-hollow, semi-shinigami. He breaks the mask and Urahara moves on to the third lesson: defeat Urahara.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155089/screencap/63bb60fd2d811.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"一護, ホロウに墜ちる!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichimaru Gin`s Shadow\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2005-02-22\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo finishes his training with Urahara and learns how to control his Soul Slayer. Seven days after his training is complete Ichigo, Orihime, Chad and Uuryu prepare to leave for the Soul Society with Yoruichi-san as their guide.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/155090/screencap/63bb610fc4d3b.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"市丸ギンの影\"},{\"title\":\"Enter! The World of the Shinigami\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-19\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"When Byakuya comes to Rukia's cell, he finds out that she is being rescued. In an attempt to kill them, Ichigo comes flying in and saving the day. Will he succeed?\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/313428/screencap/63bb642092991.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"突入! 死神の世界\"},{\"title\":\"The Man who Hates Shinigami\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Standing before the The White Road Gate is Captain Gin Ichimaru of the Third Company.  Unaware that Gin is a Soul Reaper Captain, Ichigo sets upon him, ignoring Yoruichi`s warnings.  Upon hearing Ichigo`s name, Gin draws his Zanpakuto and attacks, forcing Ichigo to use Zangetsu to protect himself.  Unable to open the gates, disappointment fills the entourage.  Just then, the residents of Rukongai who had stayed hidden, come out onto the streets.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神を憎む男\"},{\"title\":\"14 Days Before Rukia`s Execution\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his entourage are attacked by men on boars.  Ichigo crosses swords with their leader, Ganju, but in the middle of the fight, Ganju is shocked at the time on the clock and dashes off.   Ichigo and his friends are shocked at this boar gang which has disappeared just as quickly as they appeared.  The following morning, they prepare to set out in search of Kukaku Shiba who may hold the key to getting inside Soul Society.  But Ichigo, whose match the previous night remains unfinished, is determined to stay back.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキア処刑, 14日前\"},{\"title\":\"Assemble! The 13 Divisions\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kukaku Shiba, the one who knows how to get into Soul Society is Rokongai`s top pyrotechnist.  Furthermore, she is the older sister of Ganju, who appeared the previous night on a boar.  Kukaku explains how she will get them into Soul Society.  She will gather their spiritual energy and form it into a giant ball and fire it like a cannon into the skies over Soul Society.  Although it sounds ridiculous, the entourage prepare to create a giant cannonball of spiritual energy.  And Ganju, it seems, has a grudge against Soul Reapers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結集! 護廷13隊\"},{\"title\":\"Penetrate the Center with an Enormous Bombshell?\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"2005-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With some advice from Ganju, Ichigo is finally able to control his spiritual energy in order to create the Cannonball.  Now that they are ready to go, Yoruichi gives the group directions on what to do when they get to Soul Society.  But Ichigo is totally spent from practice and falls asleep.  Next to the sleeping Ichigo, Ganju feverishly practices the words that will control the Cannonball.  He has decided to go to Soul Society with the group.  And just before their departure, he explains the reason for his hatred of Soul Reapers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨大砲弾で中央突破?\"},{\"title\":\"Formation! The Worst Tag\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Cannonball is launched, and Ichigo and company make it over Seireitai.  But because Ichigo is unable to control his spiritual power, they become stuck within the shakonaku (Soul Shield Membrane).  Ichigo and the others desperately try to collect their spiritual energy, but in that instant, the Cannonball explodes and everyone begins a descent towards Seireitei -- Ishida with Orihime, Chad, Yoriuchi, and finally, Ichigo with Ganju.  Ichigo and Ganju make a safe landing, but are confronted by Ikkaku and Yumichika, two Soul Reapers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"結成! 最悪のタッグ\"},{\"title\":\"Release the Death Blow!\",\"number\":27,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside the Seireitei, orders are given and a full-fledged search for the Ryoka is called into action.  Rukia is transferred to the Shishinro Repentence Cell to await her execution and it is becomes more imperative that Ichigo and his fellow Ryoka learn of her whereabouts soon.  Ichigo and Ikkaku`s fight dramatically comes to a close; Ganju and Yumichika challenge each other`s tempers during their continued battle; and Uryu and Orihime find themselves trapped in a raucous chase by a group of Soul Reapers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"必殺の一撃を放て!\"},{\"title\":\"Orihime Targeted\",\"number\":28,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Forced to stay alert and on their toes. Ichigo and the others continue to be hunted by Soul Reapers.  Uryu and Orihime struggle to outwit Squad 11`s Captain Zaraki and Lieutenant Yachiru in their ongoing chase, but end up in an even more threatening encounter with Jirobo, a towering Soul Reaper, who quickly identifies Uryu as a Quincy.  Yumichika`s obsession with vanity is amplified as Ganju relentlessly tries to conquer him in battle.  In his search to find Ganju, Ichigo finds himself chased by a new slew of soul reapers as he makes his way through the maze of walls.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"狙われた織姫\"},{\"title\":\"Breakthrough! The Shinigami`s Encompassing Net\",\"number\":29,\"airDate\":\"2005-04-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu`s days of training pay off as he is able to protect Orihime and himself from Jirobo and his zanpaku-to, known as Tsunzaki Garasu.   Ganju and Ichigo finally run into each other, but each brings with them a trail of angry Soul Reapers.  Their attempt to hold the weak and unappreciated Hanataro hostage fails when they learn that he is a member of the weakest squad.  Meanwhile, Captain Kurotsuchi questions Ikkaku about the intruding Ryoka with no success.  However, when Captain Zaraki arrives, Ikkaku`s tongue begins to loosen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"突破せよ! 死神包囲網\"},{\"title\":\"Renji`s Confrontation\",\"number\":30,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hanataro leads Ichigo and Ganju toward the Repentance Cell where Rukia is being imprisoned using an underground network of sewage system passageways.  As Hanataro guides them, he recounts the stories that Rukia had told him about her time in the world of the living with Ichigo.  Upon their arrival just outside the White Tower, Renji Abarai appears and challenges Ichigo to a fight to the finish. Uryu and Orihime, still separated from Ichigo and Ganju, sense Ichigo`s rising Spirit Energy as he prepares for battle against the powerful Lieutenant.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"立ちはだかる恋次\"},{\"title\":\"The Resolution to Kill\",\"number\":31,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Renji and Ichigo engage in battle, Ichigo remembers his days of intensive training under Urahara prior to entering the Seireitei.  Ichigo is forced to face and overcome his biggest fears as he proves that he has indeed developed into a opponent strong enough to face Renji.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"斬る為の覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"The Star and the Stray Dog\",\"number\":32,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Renji faces defeat, and in his last living moments, recalls his youth, struggling as a poor street kid with Rukia in \\\"Hanging Dog\\\" aka the  Seventy-Eighth District of South Rukongai.  He describes how they both came to move to the Seireitei to become Soul Reapers, and Rukia`s adoption into the noble Kuchiki family.  As Renji struggles to atone for the sins of his life, he blames himself for Rukia`s forthcoming execution.  In his final breaths, Renji asks Ichigo to promise to save Rukia.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"星と野良犬\"},{\"title\":\"Miracle! New Hero of Enigma\",\"number\":33,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Back in the world of the living, Karin and Yuzu find themselves entrusted with a mysterious cat that falls from the sky which draws the attention of a number of deadly Hollows.  Along with Jinta and Ururu, they are recruited by television personality Don Kanonji to learn how to fight bad spirits and protect their town.  Although they are skeptical about working under Don Kanonji`s leadership, they are excited about becoming television stars, known as \\\"Karakura Superheroes.\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"奇跡! 謎の新ヒーロー\"},{\"title\":\"Tragedy of Dawn\",\"number\":34,\"airDate\":\"2005-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After word spreads of Renji`s defeat, an all-out war is declared on the Ryoka, allowing all Captains of the Seiretei permission to carry and release their zanpaku-tos. However, Momo Hinamori becomes increasingly suspicious about the changes taking place around her.  In the underground sewage tunnels of the Seireitei, Hanataro continues to treat Ichigo`s wounds inflicted during his battle with Renji.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夜明けの惨劇\"},{\"title\":\"Aizen Assassination! The Creeping Darkness\",\"number\":35,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Captain Aizen is discovered slain and hung, Hinamori quickly suspects Ichimaru.  In a bout of revenge, Hinamori tries to attack Ichimaru, but is stopped first by Lieutenant Kira and then by Toshiro Hitsugaya, the captain of Squad 10.  Ichigo and Ganju continue to receive healing treatments from Hanatoro until they are well enough to continue their journey to the White Tower.  Meanwhile, Chad learns the whereabouts of Rukia and the White Tower and makes his own way toward the Senzaikyu, unaware that he has been detected by Lieutenant Ise and Captain Kyoraku.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"藍染暗殺! 忍び寄る闇\"},{\"title\":\"Zaraki Kenpachi, drawing close!\",\"number\":36,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Ichigo, Ganju, and Hanataro make their way to the top of the Senzaikyu staircase, they sense an unprecedented, vast amount of unrecognizable spirit energy.  The source of this spirit energy reveals itself as Kenpachi Zaraki, the captain of Squad 11, who Ichigo had been earlier warned of during his battle with Ikkaku Madarame.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"更木剣八, 迫る!\"},{\"title\":\"The Reason for Fists\",\"number\":37,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chad`s journey to the Senzaikyu is interrupted by the Captain of Squad 8, Shunsui Kyouraka.  Kyouraka`s laid-back mentality and attempt to convince Chad to retreat irks Chad and tries his patience.  Chad realizes that time is of the essence and that he must proceed to meet the rest of the Ryoka.  As Chad starts to battle, he has flashbacks to the world of the living where he is reminded of his promise to Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"拳の理由\"},{\"title\":\"Driven into a Corner! Broken Zangetsu\",\"number\":38,\"airDate\":\"2005-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chad continues to persevere against Captain Kyouraka.  Ichigo, still battling Captain Zaraki at the Senzaikyu, senses a loss of Chad`s Spirit Energy and fears for the worst.  Ichigo grows angrier and more determined as his sense of responsibility for the rest of the Ryoka increases, leading him to stand up to Zaraki in battle...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命! 折られた斬月\"},{\"title\":\"Immortal Man\",\"number\":39,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After being attacked by Captain Zaraki`s sword, while lying weak on the ground, Ichigo is greeted by a metaphysical version of his zanpaku-to, Zangetsu.  Zangetsu takes Ichigo to develop his understanding about the nature of his zanpaku-to.  When Ichigo calls a surprised Captain Zaraki into battle again, he has a renewed confidence in the strength of his fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"不死身の男\"},{\"title\":\"The Shinigami Ganju Saw\",\"number\":40,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Captain Zaraki lie motionless on the ground after their battle.  Zaraki admits defeat and remains alive just long enough to recount his meeting with Yachiru.  Yoruichi finds Ichigo and takes him away for treatment. Ganju and Hanataro continue toward the White Tower to save Rukia.  When they arrive in Rukia`s holding cell, Ganju realizes that Rukia is not who he expected her to be...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ガンジュの見た死神\"},{\"title\":\"Reunion, Ichigo and Rukia\",\"number\":41,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoruichi`s true form is revealed, much to Ichigo`s surprise.  Ichigo finds a mysterious mask that he remembered Hanatoro throwing into an underground tunnel.   Sensing great Spirit Energy near the Repentance Cell, Ichigo defies Yoruichi`s orders and flees to assist Ganju and Hanatoro.  Captain Kuchiki and Captain Ukitake are both surprised by Ichigo`s Captain-like level of Spirit Energy.  Rukia is upset with Ichigo for coming to the Soul Society, but it does not sway Ichigo`s determination to save her...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再会, 一護とルキア\"},{\"title\":\"Shunshin (God of Flash) Yoruichi, Dance!\",\"number\":42,\"airDate\":\"2005-07-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoruichi appears as Ichigo prepares to face Squad captains Kuchiki and Ukitake.  In order to save Ichigo from a fool`s battle, Yoruichi pounds an anesthetic into Ichigo, rendering him unconscious.  Yoruichi`s flash steps prevent the two of them from being struck by Kuchiki, and she promises to return in three days when Ichigo will be stronger.  Meanwhile, Orihime decides that she and Uryu should disguise themselves as Soul Reapers to reach Rukia`s cell.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"瞬神夜一, 舞う!\"},{\"title\":\"Vicious Shinigami\",\"number\":43,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orihime and Uryu, dressed as Soul Reapers, are met by members of Squad 12 who offer to help them, but Uryu quickly realizes that it is a trap. Squad 12`s Captain Kurotsuchi presents himself to Orihime and Uryu, criticizing Uryu as a Quincy who has no chance of winning this fight.  Uryu orders one of the remaining members of Squad 11 in the area to take Orihime and run away, acknowledging the fact that Kurotusuchi is more interested in her than a mere Quincy.  As their fight progresses, Kurotsuchi`s actions and words become increasingly more provocative and infuriating to Uryu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"卑劣な死神\"},{\"title\":\"Ishida, Extreme Limits of his Power!\",\"number\":44,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu has taken it upon himself to avenge the humiliation of Soken Ishida, his Quincy master and grandfather, by continuing to relentlessly battle Captain Kurotsuchi. Uryu draws upon all of the lessons he has learned, and powers he has skillfully obtained, leading Kurotsuchi to decide that rather than kill Uryu, he wishes to capture him so as to study his distinctive powers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石田, 極限の力!\"},{\"title\":\"Exceeding the Limits!\",\"number\":45,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoruichi trains Ichigo, educating him about the potential to transcribe a zanpaku-to`s main form and materialize it.  He is moving toward bankai training from the shikai training of dialogue and harmonization, and to do so he must face and conquer difficult challenges set forth by Zangetsu.   Uryu, Ganju, and Chad are reunited in a shared prison cell, where they wonder why their wounds have been treated and they haven`t been killed.  Orihime has also been captured and kept alive, although she is in a different holding location.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"限界を越えろ!\"},{\"title\":\"Authentication! The School of Shinigami\",\"number\":46,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Momo recalls her training at the Soul Reaper Academy, where she recounts meeting and being a member of a group field training session with Izuru Kira and Renji Abarai where they must venture to the World of the Living and participate in a training exercise against Dummy Hollows.  It is also at the Soul Reaper Academy where she first meets Captain Aizen, where he compliments her as a outstanding student among her classmates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"実録! 死神の学校\"},{\"title\":\"Those Who Take Revenge\",\"number\":47,\"airDate\":\"2005-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Momo, Renji and Kira have all escaped from their cells.  Momo, having read the letter that Captain Aizen left for her, believes that she understands the true reason behind Rukia and that she has identified Aizen`s killer.  However, when faced with the presumed culprit, Momo weakens with confusion and the possibility of a faked letter becomes increasingly evident.   Meanwhile, Ichigo completes Day 1 of his training under Yoruichi, and uncovers some interesting background information about Kisuke Urahara aka Mr. Hat and Clogs.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"仇討つ者たち\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya, Howl!\",\"number\":48,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia`s execution date is advanced to a final time on the following day.  Toshiro wonders if the acquisition of the Sokyoku is actually the intent of Ichimaru.  Renji Abarai joins Yoruichi and Ichigo on the same training ground, with the similar goal of attaining  bankai.  Renji brings with him news of the twenty-nine hour countdown to Rukia`s execution.  In her holding cell, Rukia has a revealing dream that she understands as preparation of her strength and comprehension of the next day`s events.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷, 吼える!\"},{\"title\":\"Rukia`s Nightmare\",\"number\":49,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Within Rukia`s dream, she recalls the past which she spent training under Lieutenant Kaien and Captain Ukitake.  The young Rukia admires the Lieutenant very much, and has a difficult time acknowledging what she must do after his body is taken over by a Hollow, set to attack the rest of her Squad members.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキアの悪夢\"},{\"title\":\"Resurrected Lion\",\"number\":50,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the world of the living, Don Kanonji searches for a way to save his television show, as its ratings continue to plummet. He discovers Kon- the mod-spirit trapped inside the body of a stuffed animal- and decides to make Kon the mascot of his show.  After naming Kon, \\\"Karakura King\\\", he is able to attract Yuzu, Jinta, and Ururu back to his cause, and they become Karakura Pink, Yellow, and Red: superheroes of Don Kanonji`s television show.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"よみがえる獅子\"},{\"title\":\"The Morning of the Execution\",\"number\":51,\"airDate\":\"2005-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Preparations are underway for Rukia`s execution, when Ganju, Uryu, and Chad receive unannounced visitors to their prison cell.  Kenpachi, Yumichika, Yachiru along with Orihime, break into the prison cell to assist the Ryoka in an escape.  Once they are discovered by Captain Komamura, Captain Tosen, Lieutenant Iba, and Lieutenant Hisagi, Kenpachi is left to prove his strength once again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"処刑の朝\"},{\"title\":\"Renji, Vow to his Soul! Battle to the Death with Byakuya\",\"number\":52,\"airDate\":\"2005-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Ichigo continues his Bankai training, Renji emerges from his own Bankai training to save Rukia.  But standing in his way is none other than his own captain -- Byakuya Kuchiki.  Does Renji have the strength to defeat his one-time comrade or will he be ripped to shreds?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恋次, 魂の誓い! 白哉との死闘\"},{\"title\":\"Ichimaru Gin`s Temptation, Destroyed Resolution\",\"number\":53,\"airDate\":\"2005-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Rukia Kuchiki is being lead to her execution, she is stopped by the ever-devious Gin Ichimaru. Just when Rukia has prepared herself for death, her concentration is broken by Gin`s offer to let her live and her concern over Renji, whose pain she can sense. Driven by his intense hatred for Kenpachi Zaraki`s bloodlust, Kaname Tosen, along with his confidant Sajin Komamura, challenge Kenpachi to a fierce battle between captains.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"市丸ギンの誘惑, 崩された覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"An Accomplished Oath! Get back Rukia!\",\"number\":54,\"airDate\":\"2005-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia stands on the Sokyoku at the brink of her execution, not knowing that help is on the way. Captain Ukitake, Captain Kyoraku, Ichigo, and his dedicated comrades are all racing to save her life. Will they make it in time or will the power of one million zanpaku-to consume her life?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"果たされる誓い! ルキア奪還なるか!\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Shinigami! The Ultimate Teacher and Student Showdown\",\"number\":55,\"airDate\":\"2005-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Renji hurries to get Rukia out of harm`s way, Ichigo stays behind to hold off Byakuya Kuchiki. Though Rukia was wrong about Ichigo`s ability to save her from execution, she does not believe that he can survive another battle with her brother. In an attempt to distract Soi Fon, Yoruichi comes to Ichigo`s aid and battles her. At the same time, Captain Ukitake and Captain Kyoraku are in hot water as Head Captain Yamamoto takes the punishment of his two most trusted captains into his own hands for their assisting in the rescue of Rukia.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強の死神! 究極の師弟対決\"},{\"title\":\"High Speed Battle! The Goddess Warrior, Decided\",\"number\":56,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captain Ukitake and Captain Kyoraku face the punishment meted out by Head Captain Yamamoto`s zanpaku-to. Ukitake and Kyoraku were the first two men to graduate from the Soul Reaper Academy, but even though they are two accomplished captains fighting as allies, the odds do not appear to be on their side. After coming to Ichigo`s rescue, Yoruichi learns that her encounter with former subordinate Soi Fon is going to be much more than just a scuffle. After one hundred years of training, Soi Fon has developed plenty of talent as a warrior, though she may be a bit too sure of her skill.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"超速の戦い! 武の女神, 決す\"},{\"title\":\"Senbonzakura, Crushed! Zangetsu Thrusts Through the Sky\",\"number\":57,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Fueled by anger and feelings of abandonment and betrayal, Soi Fon persists in her attempt to destroy her former master Yoruichi Shihouin, but her abilities may be hampered by her cocksure attitude. At the execution site, the battle between Ichigo and Byakuya Kuchiki continues. Having completed his bankai training, Ichigo has a newfound confidence that may be the key factor in his attacks against Byakuya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"千本桜, 粉砕! 天を衝く斬月\"},{\"title\":\"Open! The Black Blade, Power of a Miracle\",\"number\":58,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The fierce battle between Ichigo and Captain Byakuya rages on. Ichigo taunts Byakuya and demands that he use his bankai against him, while Byakuya remains visibly unmoved by Ichigo`s amazing display of power. Meanwhile, Uryu, Chad, Orihime, Ganju, and their new Soul Reaper friend, \\\"Mini Mustache,\\\" are having trouble navigating through the Seireitei. Ichigo may be out of luck if he needs his friends to come to his aid this time.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"開放! 黒き刃, 奇跡の力\"},{\"title\":\"Conclusion of the Battle! White Pride and Black Thoughts\",\"number\":59,\"airDate\":\"2005-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Byakuya Kuchiki may have been impressed by the power exerted by Ichigo, the substitute Soul Reaper, but he`s not done fighting yet. With spiritual pressure shaking the entire Seireitei, Orihime, Chad, Uryu, and Ganju wait helplessly nearby, knowing that all they can do is hope that their friend Ichigo will survive this vicious battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死闘決着! 白き誇りと黒き想い\"},{\"title\":\"Reality of the Despair, the Assassin`s Dagger is Swung\",\"number\":60,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Central 46 is the highest judicial body in the Soul Society. After breaking into Central 46, Captain Hitsugaya and Rangiku discover that the forty Sages and six Judges were slaughtered days earlier. Captain Hitsugaya and Rangiku soon find that they are not the only ones that have come to investigate the scene.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶望の真実, 振り下ろされた凶刃\"},{\"title\":\"Aizen Stands! Horrible Ambitions\",\"number\":61,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After defeating Hitsugaya, Captain Aizen heads for the Execution Grounds. Renji is dumbfounded as he finds himself facing Captains Aizen, Ichimaru, and Tossen at Sokyoku hill, the very same place that he was carrying Rukia away from. Captain Aizen demands Renji to put Rukia down and disappear, but there is no way Renji is going to abandon his childhood friend.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"藍染, 立つ! 恐るべき野望\"},{\"title\":\"Gather Together! Army of the Strongest Shinigami!\",\"number\":62,\"airDate\":\"2005-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Furious after hearing the news of the defection of three captains, Sajin Komamura arrives at the Sokyoku ready to beat the treachery out of Aizen and his lackeys. Captain Komamura quickly realizes that deception is even a part of Sosuke Aizen`s fighting technique, and the rogue captain proves to be more of a challenge than he expected. Ichigo, battered after his clash with Byakuya Kuchiki, lies helplessly on the sidelines, watching this battle between captains.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"集結せよ! 最強の死神軍団\"},{\"title\":\"Rukia`s Decision, Ichigo`s Feelings\",\"number\":63,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-10\",\"duration\":50,\"synopsis\":\"eace returns as the Soul Society recuperates from the deep wounds left by the treachery of Captain Aizen and his partners in crime. Captain Komamura and Lieutenant Hisagi visit the graves of fallen comrades, while Hitsugaya visits Hinamori and hopes for her quick recovery from the wounds she received from Captain Aizen. Ichigo has recovered from his own injuries, and in the district of Squad Eleven he meets up with Orihime, who informs him that Rukia has gone missing.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキアの決意, 一護の想い\"},{\"title\":\"New School Term, Renji has come to the Material World?!\",\"number\":64,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends have returned from the Soul Society and are finally able to get back to their \\\"normal\\\" lives. On the first day back at school, Renji shows up unannounced, dressed in his out-dated seventies` fashion. Since things have settled down in the Soul Society, Renji has been sent to Karakura Town to oversee the eradication of Hollows, and Ichigo has no choice but to work with him. Meanwhile, Yoruichi has become aware of an unusual presence in town.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新学期, 現世に恋次がやって来た!?\"},{\"title\":\"Creeping Fear, The Second Victim\",\"number\":65,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends meet at school and set out to look for Orihime the day after her disappearance. It seems that her school chums have lost all memories of her existence. The only clue that Ichigo and the others find at the site of her disappearance is a bizarre, round footprint. Renji gets a call on his Soul Pager telling him, \\\"I have your friend. You`ll get her back if you win.\\\"\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍び寄る恐怖, 2番目の犠牲者\"},{\"title\":\"Break Through! Trap that Lurks in the Maze\",\"number\":66,\"airDate\":\"2006-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Chad`s kidnapping, Ichigo and the others go to Urahara to explain their predicament. Ichigo receives a phone call from Lirin who instructs Ichigo to bring all of his friends to the Karakura Museum. Though they know they are walking into a trap, they go to the museum and immediately find themselves stuck inside a labyrinth that they must navigate their way through in order to free their friends.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"突破せよ! 迷宮に潜む罠\"},{\"title\":\"Game of Death! Disappearing Classmate\",\"number\":67,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chad and Orihime are rescued, but when Lirin tells them that one of their friends has been replaced by an impostor, they realize that the game is not over. Ichigo, Renji, Uryu, Chad, and Orihime struggle to figure out which one of them is the phony, and if they don`t hurry, all of their classmates will disappear.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死のゲーム! 消えるクラスメイト\"},{\"title\":\"The Demon`s True Form, The Secret Revealed\",\"number\":68,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lirin sets in place a giant gate that begins to devour everything in Karakura Town. The only way to have Chad released and save the town is to destroy the gate. Ichigo and the others have only thirty minutes before the gate sucks up everything in the vicinity. Meanwhile, Yoruichi and Soifon discover a strange soul wandering the streets of the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪魔の正体, 明かされた秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Its Name is Bount! Those Who Hunt Souls\",\"number\":69,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"New information has come to light regarding an unusual race known as Bounts. Kisuke Urahara explains that Bounts are beings that gain eternal life by absorbing the souls of humans. Urahara warns Ichigo that he and his friends may be in danger because Bounts tend to target humans with high-level abilities. Lirin, Noba, and Kurodo prove to be very useful when it`s revealed that they all contain reishi sensors that can detect Bounts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"その名はバウント! 魂を狩る者たち\"},{\"title\":\"Rukia`s Return! Substitute Team Revival\",\"number\":70,\"airDate\":\"2006-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Lirin find themselves in a pinch when they are attacked by the Bount Yoshino Soma and her Doll, Goethe. An unexpected visit from Rukia comes just in the nick of time, but she and Ichigo appear to be outmatched when the Bount Ryo Udagawa and his Doll, Friede, join the fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキアの帰還! 代行チーム復活\"},{\"title\":\"The Moment of Collision!! An Evil Hand Draws Near to the Quincy\",\"number\":71,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, Rukia, Orihime, Chad, and Uryu surround the Bount Ryo Udagawa, but they find themselves at a slight disadvantage when he releases the immense power of his Doll, Friede. Friede`s snakelike attacks are quickly directed towards Uryu when Udagawa finds out that Uryu is a Quincy.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突の時! クインシーに迫る魔の手\"},{\"title\":\"Water assault! Escape from the closed hospital\",\"number\":72,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Upon visiting Uryu in the hospital, Ichigo and Rukia must fight off a wave of rushing water that turns into a water doll belonging to two malevolent Bounts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"水の攻撃! 閉ざされた病院からの脱出\"},{\"title\":\"Gathering at the Place of Fortune! The Man who makes his Move\",\"number\":73,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Ichigo and his friends try to fight off Ho and Ban, the two Bounts, Udagawa tries to persuade Yoshino, a renegade bount, to return to Master Kariya`s fold.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"場運と集結! 動き出す男\"},{\"title\":\"Memories of an Eternally Living Clan\",\"number\":74,\"airDate\":\"2006-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoshino finds Uryu and takes him back to her home to protect him. There, she reveals to Uryu her difficult life as a Bount and hope she had been given by Kariya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"永遠を生きる一族の記憶\"},{\"title\":\"Earth-Shattering Event at 11th Squad! The Shinigami who Rises Again\",\"number\":75,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Thrown together by fate, Uryu and Yoshino find themselves strange allies in a desperate fight against Koga and his feminine killing machine, Dalc.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"十一番隊激震! よみがえった死神\"},{\"title\":\"Crashing Force! Frido vs Zangetsu\",\"number\":76,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, Rukia, Ririn, Noba, and Kurodo enter Jin Kariya`s mansion and come face to face with him and the other Bounts.  As Ichigo challenges Udagawa. Rukia rushes deeper into the mansion to rescue Uryu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"力の激突! フリードVS斬月\"},{\"title\":\"Unquellable Hatred! The Shinigami that Kenpachi Cut Down\",\"number\":77,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the depths of Kariya`s mansion, Ichigo faces off against Maki Ichinose, a soul reaper formerly of Squad 11.  But before he can cast the final blow on Ichigo, Kariya steps in and approaches Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"消えぬ怨念! 剣八が斬った死神\"},{\"title\":\"The Gotei 13, Shocked!! Truth Buried by History\",\"number\":78,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"His confidence lost from battling Kariya, Ichigo undergoes more training with Ganju and Renji to regain his courage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"護廷十三隊驚愕!! 歴史に埋もれた真実\"},{\"title\":\"Yoshino`s Decision of Death\",\"number\":79,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoshino leaves Urahara`s Shop and heads for Kariya`s mansion to finally destroy him once and for all.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"芳野, 死をかけた想い\"},{\"title\":\"Assault From a Formidable Enemy! A Tiny Final Line of Defense?!\",\"number\":80,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In preparation for the Bounts` next attack, Lirin, Kurodo and Noba set up a bunch of traps, specifically designed for catching Bounts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"強敵の急襲! 小さな最終防衛線!?\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya Moves! The Attacked City\",\"number\":81,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Bounts have released an army of Bittos, soul-sucking monsters, throughout Karakura Town.  With the Stealth Force unable to capture them, Hitsugaya puts together a team of soul reapers to head up to the World of the Living and stop them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷動く! 襲われた街\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo vs. Dalk! The Appearance of the Faded Darkness\",\"number\":82,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kariya sends his fellow Bounts to stop Ichigo and his friends.  After Ichigo stops a Bitto from taking Keigo`s soul, he`s attacked by Koga and his doll Dalc, filled with new power she received from the Bittos.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護VSダルク! 白き闇の出現\"},{\"title\":\"Gray Shadow, The Secret of the Dolls\",\"number\":83,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Deeply engaged in battle, Koga warns Ichigo that if he doesn`t back down soon, his life will be snuffed out.  But Ichigo is never one to back down from a challenge...\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"灰色の影, ドールの秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Breaking Up of the Substitute Team? The Betrayal of Rukia\",\"number\":84,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As Hanataro does his best to heal Renji, it`s up to Rukia, Kurodo and Orihime to fight off the Bount, Yoshi and her vicious dolls.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"代行チーム分裂? 裏切ったルキア\"},{\"title\":\"Battle of Tears! Rukia vs. Orihime\",\"number\":85,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Possessed by Mabashi the Bount`s doll, Ritz, Rukia attacks her friends with all her powers. Will Orihime`s desperate pleas and Shun Shun Rikka powers be enough to save them?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"涙の死闘! ルキアvs織姫\"},{\"title\":\"Rangiku Dances! Cut Down the Invisible Enemy\",\"number\":86,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chad, Noba and Ururu have their work cut out for them when they take on Sawatari`s doll, Baura, which appears to be a giant fish.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"乱菊舞う! 見えない敵を斬れ\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya Assembles! The Gotei 13 Make Their Move\",\"number\":87,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Combining all their powers, Chad, Noba and Rangiku put together a plan to stop Sawatari and Baura.  Will they defeat this elderly bount or will they turn into fish food?\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉召集! 動き出す護廷十三隊\"},{\"title\":\"Annihilation of the Vice Captains!? Trap in the Underground Cave\",\"number\":88,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia, Chad, Orihime, Noba, and Kurodo return to Urahara`s Shop. While getting medical treatment, they discuss how the Bounts are fighting with more power than ever. Meanwhile, Yumichika discovers the cave in which Kariya and his gang are hidden—the ruins where ancient Bounts used to live in hiding. Rangiku, Izuru, Shuhei, and Yumichika enter the cave where one of the Bounts, Ugaki, has set up an enormous trap using Doll Gesell.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"副隊長全滅!? 地下洞窟の罠\"},{\"title\":\"Rematch?! Ishida vs. Nemu\",\"number\":89,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, Renji, Rukia, Chad, Orihime, and the others enter the cavernous hideout of the Bounts. As they cautiously proceed, the eyes of the Doll Gesell suddenly appear. They follow Gesell`s eyes deeper into the cave and a battle ensues. Meanwhile, Squad 12 Lieutenant Nemu Kurotsuchi confronts Uryu, who was training deep in the mountains to regain his powers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再戦!? 石田 VS ネム\"},{\"title\":\"Abarai Renji, Soul of Bankai!\",\"number\":90,\"airDate\":\"2006-07-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Near the end of Gesell`s labyrinth, the Doll  reveals her true form to Ichigo and Renji. Ichigo stands ready with his zangetsu, but Renji steps forward and insists on taking her on solo. Renji, who has been fighting alongside Ichigo since arriving in the World of the Living, regrets his past carelessness. Feeling guilty that he was unable to save some souls, Renji wants to turn this desperate situation into an opportunity to redeem himself. A fierce battle between Renji and Gesell in their true forms is about to begin.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"阿散井恋次, 魂の卍解!\"},{\"title\":\"Shinigami and Quincy, the Reviving Power\",\"number\":91,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The true mission of the Bounts is disclosed by Jin Kariya during a burly fight with Ichigo.  Kariya explains the origin of the Bounts and their plan to destroy the Soul Society.  As their brawl advances, Ichigo`s Getsugatensho is proven useless as his very own Zanpakuto is turned against him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神とクインシー, よみがえる力\"},{\"title\":\"Enter the World of the Shinigami Again\",\"number\":92,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Bounts arrive in the Soul Society and find themselves immediately engaged in war.  Kariya and Koga are greeted by two of the Seireitei`s finest, Squad 2 Lieutenant Marechiyo Omaeda and Squad 7 Lieutenant Tetsuzaemon Iba.  The Bounts` ability to rapidly gain power by absorbing reishi while in the Soul Society has tipped the scales in their favor considerably. Ichigo and the others are in for a suprise when they find out that the metal doll, Dalk, is stronger than ever and eager to terrorize the men of the Soul Society.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神世界への突入, 再び\"},{\"title\":\"Assault of the Bounts! Chaos in the Gotei 13\",\"number\":93,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Back in the Soul Society, Rukia is at a stand still as she faces the ever arogant Yoshi in the middle of the Rukon District.  With Lirin by her side and lacking most of her Soul Reaper powers, Rukia decides to stay and fight with what little spirit energy she has left. A Mod Soul and Martial Arts might not be enough to take on the reishi absorbing, blood thirsty Yoshi and her Nieder Sword Attacks this time.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"バウント強襲! 激震の護廷十三隊\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya`s Resolution! The Moment of Conflict Approaches\",\"number\":94,\"airDate\":\"2006-08-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There is quite a bit of commotion in the Soul Society as an explosion at the Shishinro Repentance Cell marks the declaration of war by Jin Kariya.  The  Bounts are causing a raucous and exhibiting their power in Kusjishi, the roughest part of the Rukon District, while the entire Soul Society prepares for the unavoidable war.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷の決意! 激突の時迫る\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya Takes the Field! Dance of the Wind-Splitting Cherry Blossoms\",\"number\":95,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A fight in the forest is on as Jin Kariya and Captain Byakuya Kuchiki meet for the first time.  A colossal amount of spiritual pressure surges through the trees when the power of these two veteran warriors collides. Kariya gloats as he effortlessly pairs his newly introduced Doll against Byakuya`s Zanpakuto but neither of these two forces is easily discouraged.  Meanwhile, Koga and Ichinose are hard at work recruiting the residents of Kusajishi to help take on the Seireitei.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉出陣! 風を裂く桜の舞\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Byakuya Kariya, Battle of the Three Extremes!\",\"number\":96,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo rushes to the site where Byakuya and Kariya are fighting and releases his Bankai upon Kariya. Byakuya also releases his Bankai to attack Kariya, but Ichigo and Byakuya are not in sync and can`t harm Kariya. The three reach a deadlock. Suddenly someone attacks with immense spiritual pressure. She calls herself Rantao and is the creator of the Bounts. Meanwhile, Ganju and others arrive at Bull`s hideout in Kusajishi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護・白哉・狩矢, 三極の戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya Moves Out! Cut Down the Enemy in the Forest\",\"number\":97,\"airDate\":\"2006-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hitsugaya learns that the Bounts have gathered mobs of followers, so he goes to the forest in Kusajishi with Rangiku and Renji and starts investigating. Meanwhile, buildings in the Seireitei that were destroyed by Ichinose are being restored. Mayuri notices something and returns to the Department of Research and Development. In the meantime, Kenpachi and Yachiru get ready for a fight at the Squad 11 barracks. The tension in the Seireitei heightens as the Bounts make their move.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷出撃! 森の中の敵を斬れ\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! Zaraki Kenpachi vs. Ichinose Maki\",\"number\":98,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hitsugaya and the others arrive at the Bounts` hideout, where Ichinose is waiting for them alone. Ichinose plans to detain them himself to help Kariya and his group, who are already headed for the Seireitei. Ichigo and Chad arrive, and with the others, they surround Ichinose, and he releases his zanpakuto, Nijigasumi, to take control of Ichigo and others. But someone appears in the crowd and blows out Ichinose`s Nijigasumi with immense spiritual pressure.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! 更木剣八VS一之瀬真樹\"},{\"title\":\"Shinigami vs. Shinigami! The Uncontrollable Power\",\"number\":99,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kariya and the others successfully open the Seireimon using the mobs from Kusajishi. Upon entering, they attack not only the Soul Reaper guards, but the mobs as well—and confusion reigns. Ichigo and the others leave Orihime to take care of the injured gate guards and enter the Seireitei. In the Seireitei, the captains hold an officers` meeting to discuss what action they will take. Meanwhile, the Bount Mabashi enters the Seireitei and attacks the Soul Reapers using Ritze.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神VS死神! 暴走する力\"},{\"title\":\"Soi Fon Dies? The Last of the Secret Mobile Corps\",\"number\":100,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Soi Fon is poisoned by a member of her punishment force, which is under Ritze`s control. Having increased her power, Ritze now can control several Soul Reapers at a time. The punishment force Ritze controls begin fighting each other in front of Soi Fon. The poison has affected Soi Fon, and she is barely able to escape. Soul Reapers who were controlled by Ritze fight each other everywhere, causing a big disturbance in the Seireitei. Shuhei, who had fought Ritz, and Captain Komamura of Squad 7, try to save the day.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"砕蜂死す? 隠密機動の最後\"},{\"title\":\"Mayuri`s Bankai!! Sawatari Clash of the Demon\",\"number\":101,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sawatari enters the Seireitei and sees Mayuri Kurotsuchi, the captain of Squad 12. Mayuri proposes that he become a guinea pig for an experiment, but Sawatari refuses and attacks Mayuri using the Doll Baura. Mayuri releases his zanpakuto to counterattack, but he is severely injured by Baura, who has become more powerful since coming to the Soul Society. In the middle of the battle, Mayuri sees the key to Baura`s attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"マユリ卍解!! 沢渡・悪魔の激突\"},{\"title\":\"The Last Quincy! The Exploding Power\",\"number\":102,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between the Soul Reapers and Bounts intensifies. Kariya suddenly appears at the Department of Research and Development, where he looks for an original crest of the Bounts and interrogates Nemu. Ichigo and Chad arrive there and challenge Kariya. Meanwhile, Uryu battles Yoshi, who kicks the Soul Reapers out of the Seireitei. Uryu purposely changes the battle site because he doesn`t want to involve the injured Soul Reapers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後のクインシー! 暴発する力\"},{\"title\":\"Ishida, The Limit Breaching Attack!\",\"number\":103,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu is severely injured by Nieder`s attack but tries desperately to counterattack, though his weapon seems to have run out of power. Yoshi thoroughly revels in the fight in the Soul Society because she can do whatever she wants. Uryu seeks clues in an attempt to counterattack Yoshi. In the meantime, the Soul Reapers discuss what they will do after Kariya takes away the Jokai Crest, which has the power to destroy the Seireitei. The situation does not look good, and some captains no longer believe the fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石田, 限界を超えて撃て!\"},{\"title\":\"10th Squad`s Struggle to the Death! The Release of Hyourinmaru\",\"number\":104,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers of Squad 10 find Koga. Hitsugaya, with all the Soul Reapers of Squad 10, uses Kurodo as a Bount sensor and tries to capture Koga, who is hiding in the Seireitei. Under the orders of Hitsugaya and Rangiku, Squad 10 members pursue Koga, but he interferes with their communications system and attacks. Hitsugaya sees his men lying injured and decides to fight Koga alone. Hitsugaya releases Hyorinmaru and begins battling Dalk.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死闘十番隊! 氷輪丸を放て\"},{\"title\":\"Kariya! Countdown to the Detonation\",\"number\":105,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captain Hitsugaya has defeated Koga, leaving Jin Kariya as the last surviving Bount. When Hitsugaya returns to the Squad Ten barracks, he finds that Ichigo and his friends have made themselves at home while Uryu recovers from his fight with Yoshi. Jin Kariya, having obtained the Jokai Crest, has been in hiding until the Crest`s power has filled his body.  Kariya is attacked by Rantao and during their fight, the secrets from her past are revealed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"狩矢! 爆発へのカウントダウン\"},{\"title\":\"Life and Revenge! Ishida, the Ultimate Decision\",\"number\":106,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During the battle between Jin Kariya and Rantao, Karyia learns the origin of his powers. Rantao pleads with Kariya to use the Jokai Crest to save the Bounts and he is forced to remember his lifetime of oppression and his reasons to destroy the Soul Society. Meanwhile, Uryu has had time to heal and is on his way to join the fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"命と復讐! 石田, 究極の選択\"},{\"title\":\"The Swung-Down Edge! The Moment of Ruin\",\"number\":107,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo arrives just in time, as Uryu and Rantao struggle to fend off Jin Kariya. Captain Hitsugaya and the others try to go after Ichigo, but Rantao stops them. She explains that there are many Jokai Crests within the Seireitei and that there is a risk they will all explode if Kariya`s Crest is released. Squad Ten informs Head Captain Yamamoto of these possible dangers and all Soul Reapers are mobilized to find and seal the remaining Crests.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"振り下ろされた刃! 破滅の瞬間\"},{\"title\":\"The Wailing Bount! The Last Clash\",\"number\":108,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Kariya`s final clash begins on Sokyoku hill. Ichigo realizes that Kariya`s fighting style consists of counterattacks that rely on his incredible ability to recover. He uses Tensa Zangetsu`s speed to attack fiercely so that Kariya doesn`t have time to make a counterattack. Kariya is cornered and forced to release Messer`s hidden power in order to fight Ichigo. Messer can create electricity by causing friction in the air, and Ichigo is tossed about by the lightning that Messer produces. Meanwhile, the entire Seireitei is working to seal away all Jokai Crests on the orders of  the Head Captain.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"慟哭のバウント! 最後の激突\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo and Rukia, Thoughts Revolving Around Heaven\",\"number\":109,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It has been a few days since Kariya was defeated, and all of the Jokai Crests have been sealed away. Ichigo and his friends rest until the Senkaimon is prepared so that they can return to the World of the Living. Ichigo and Renji visit the Kuchiki home to see Rukia but she hasn`t fully recovered from her fight with the Bounts. Ichigo and the others reflect on their own pasts as they talk about their experience with the Bounts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護とルキア, 廻天する想い\"},{\"title\":\"Reopening of the Substitute Business! The Terrifying Transfer Student\",\"number\":110,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It`s back to high school and Hollow slaying for Ichigo Kurosaki, who is now officially recognized as a Substitute Soul Reaper by the Soul Society. On the day he returns to Karakura First High School, Ichigo meets an unusual new student named Shinji Hirako. That night, while Ichigo is fighting a Hollow, he is attacked by Shinji who is wielding a Zanpakuto. At that moment, several a massive amount of spiritual pressure approaches Karakura Town.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"代行業再開! 恐怖の転校生\"},{\"title\":\"Shock! The Father`s True Character\",\"number\":111,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu is attacked by a Menos Grande and is saved by his father, Ryuken. Ryuken defeats the Menos with a single attack. He tells Uryu that he can help him regain his powers but only under Ryuken`s conditions. Meanwhile, Kon is in Ichigo`s body and he is in trouble because he is being chased by Grand Fisher. Kon desperately tries to get away, but he is cornered in an urban area.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"驚愕! 親父達の正体\"},{\"title\":\"The Vizards and the Arrancars\",\"number\":112,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Isshin Kurosaki shows up in his Soul Reaper form and defeats Grand Fisher with a single strike. When Kisuke Urahara appears, Isshin and Kisuke discuss the fact that Sosuke Aizen has made contact with Hollows and is attempting to create a form of Hollows with Soul Reaper powers called Arrancars. Meanwhile, Shinji Hirako reveals that he has come to Karakura Town to recruit Ichigo into the Visoreds, a group of ex-Soul Reapers that have crossed over into the realm of the Hollows.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦いの始まり, 仮面の軍勢と破面\"},{\"title\":\"Prelude to the Apocalypse, The Arrancar`s Attack!\",\"number\":113,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo senses that the hollow within him is getting stronger and fears that he`ll be swallowed whole in his current state. Meanwhile, the Soul Society`s Department of Research and Development detects large amounts of spiritual pressure headed toward Karakura Town. The spiritual pressure is from fully developed Arrancars sent by Sosuke Aizen. The Arrancars begin attacking defenseless humans as soon they arrive in the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"世界崩壊への序曲, アランカル来襲!\"},{\"title\":\"Reunion, Ichigo and Rukia and Shinigamis\",\"number\":114,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orihime and Chad are in danger and Ichigo rushes to their aid. He immediately uses his Bankai and clashes with the brutish Arrancar, Yammy. Ichigo overwhelms Yammy with his speed and forces him to draw his Zanpakuto. Just then, Ichigo`s inner Hollow takes control in an attempt to disable him from continuing the fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"再会, 一護とルキアと死神たち\"},{\"title\":\"Mission! The Shinigami Who Came\",\"number\":115,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia, Renji, Ikkaku, Yumichika, Captain Hitsugaya and Rangiku have come to the World of the Living and they have found Ichigo still feeling depressed about his poor performance in the fight against the Arrancars. Ichigo quickly learns that he is not going to get away with feeling sorry for himself because Rukia has plans to snap him out of his funk, even if it means she has to beat him into shape.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"特命! やってきた死神たち\"},{\"title\":\"The Evil Eye, Aizen Again\",\"number\":116,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ulquiorra and Yammy have returned to the Hollow World, Hueco Mundo. They report to Sosuke Aizen and twenty other Arrancars about their fight with Ichigo and his friends. Ulquiorra has returned to Hueco Mundo without killing Ichigo and is ridiculed by his peers. Meanwhile, in the World of the Living, Captain Hitsugaya and the Advance Troops leave Ichigo`s house in search of a place to stay.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪しき瞳, 藍染再び\"},{\"title\":\"Rukia`s Battle Begins! The Freezing White Blade\",\"number\":117,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Arrancar, Grimmjow, has entered the World of the Living and he has brought a group of minions from Hueco Mundo with him. The Arrancars` goal is to kill anyone who possesses the slightest amount of spiritual pressure. Each of the bloodthirsty Arrancars sets out to find someone to destroy but they find a fight with well-trained Soul Reapers instead. Ichigo, Chad, and the Advance Troops fight hard to protect Karakura Town from the dangerous intruders.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキア戦闘開始! 凍りつく白き刃\"},{\"title\":\"Ikkaku`s Bankai! The Power that Breaks Everything\",\"number\":118,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ikkaku and the Arrancar, Edrad, have a fierce battle in the streets of Karakura Town. Yumichika stands aside and watches because he knows that Ikkaku will be furious if he interferes. Edrad dodges Ikkaku`s wild attacks and coldly analyzes his fighting style. He determines that Ikkaku will not admit defeat unless he shows him an overpoweringly greater strength. Meanwhile, Ichigo and Rukia defeat D Roy, and take on Grimmjow, who`s spiritual pressure is like nothing they`ve ever seen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一角卍解! 全てを砕く力\"},{\"title\":\"Team Zaraki`s Secret Story! The Lucky Men\",\"number\":119,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ikkaku releases his Bankai, Ryumon Hozukimaru, which he has kept a secret for some time. He clashes with Edrad, who shows his true power by releasing his zanpakuto. When the two enormous spiritual pressures collide, Ikkaku is thrown to the ground. As his consciousness fades, Ikkaku remembers the time before he joined the Thirteen Court Guard Squads.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"更木隊秘話! ツイている男たち\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya Scatters! The Broken Hyourinmaru\",\"number\":120,\"airDate\":\"2007-03-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers struggle against the might of the Arrancars. Despite the Arrancar Shawlong`s overwhelming strength, Captain Hitsugaya continues his attacks. Shawlong then reveals to Hitsugaya, the existence of Arrancars far more powerful then they are, the Espada, the strongest of the Arrancars. Hitsugaya shudders when he learns that one of the Espada has come to the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷散る! 砕けた氷輪丸\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! The protector vs. the Bearer\",\"number\":121,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers receive permission from the Soul Society to use Gentei Kaijo, a spiritual pressure restriction release. Soul Reaper Captains and Lieutenants have their spiritual pressure limited when they leave the Soul Society so as not to affect the spirits of the World of the Living unnecessarily. In other words, Hitsugaya and the other Soul Reapers have been fighting the Arrancars with only a fifth of their power. The Arrancars recoil at the sudden jump in spiritual pressure and decide to retreat but the Advance Troops pursue them with their attacks.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! 護る者VS被る者\"},{\"title\":\"Vizard! The Power of the Awakened\",\"number\":122,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Grimmjow is the only survivor of the Arrancars` intense battle with the Soul Reapers. He returns with Tosen to Sosuke Aizen`s palace, Las Noches in Hueco Mundo. While Aizen shows understanding towards Grimmjow`s disobedience, Tosen decides that he should still be punished for his actions. Meanwhile, having lost terribly to Grimmjow, Ichigo visits the Visored Shinji Hirako.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ヴァイザード! 目覚めし者たちの力\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo, Complete Hollowification?!\",\"number\":123,\"airDate\":\"2007-04-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo visits Shinji Hirako at the Visoreds` hideout in order to find out how to control his inner Hollow. He tries to get an answer by force, but Hiyori Sarugaki interrupts his battle with Shinji. Ichigo fights Hiyori while trying to suppress his inner Hollow but she is prepared to do everything she can to force him to release it.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護, 完全ホロウ化!?\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! The Black Bankai and the White Bankai\",\"number\":124,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo has begun training with the Visoreds in order to learn how to suppress his inner hollow. He enters his inner world and is greeted by the mirror image of himself holding a white Zangetsu. The two cross swords and release their Bankai simultaneously. Ichigo is forced to fight a more powewrful version of himself, which could be his most formidable opponent yet.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! 黒い卍解と白い卍解\"},{\"title\":\"Urgent Report! Aizen`s Terrifying Plan\",\"number\":125,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo has entered his inner world and is blocking fierce attacks made by another Ichigo who wields a white Zangetsu. Ichigo is cornered as images of Byakuya Kuchiki and Jin Kariya pummel him into the ground. Kenpachi Zaraki appears and tells Ichigo to be candid about his desire to fight and questions his determination. Meanwhile, Captain Hitsugaya and Rangiku are setting up a massive communication device at Orihime`s house so they can contact the Soul Society.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"緊急報告! 藍染の恐るべき計画\"},{\"title\":\"Uryuu vs. Ryuuken! Clash of the Parent-Child Quincys\",\"number\":126,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sosuke Aizen`s ultimate goal of killing the Soul King has been revealed. The Soul Society has learned that in order to gain access to the Royal Family`s palace, Aizen will need a key known as the Ouken. If Aizen is able to create the key, Karakura Town will be destroyed. Orihime visits Ichigo during his Visored training to inform him of this shocking discovery. Meanwhile, Uryu`s intense training to regain his Quincy powers is reaching its final stage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"雨竜VS竜弦! 激突クインシー親子\"},{\"title\":\"Urahara`s Decision, Orihime`s Thoughts\",\"number\":127,\"airDate\":\"2007-05-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends undergo exhaustive training in preparation for the upcoming winter showdown with Sosuke Aizen. Kisuke summons Orihime to his underground training facility where she finds Chad sparring with Renji. Meanwhile, Ulquiorra has returned to Hueco Mundo with information that peaks Aizen`s interest.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"浦原の決断, 織姫の想い\"},{\"title\":\"Nightmare Arrancar! Team Hitsugaya Moves Out\",\"number\":128,\"airDate\":\"2007-06-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captain Hitsugaya`s advance troops remain in Karakura Town to prepare for the showdown with Sosuke Aizen. Rangiku is fascinated by life in the world of the living, and she finds it impossible to devote her time to training. During the shopping spree of a lifetime, Rangiku`s Soul Phone alerts her of a Hollow appearance. Leaving her boy-crazy gigai behind, Rangiku arrives at the coordinates to intercept the Hollow.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢のアランカル! 日番谷隊出撃\"},{\"title\":\"Swooping Descent of the Dark Emissary! The Propagation of Malice\",\"number\":129,\"airDate\":\"2007-06-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rangiku saves a young soul named Shota from being attacked by a Mock Arrancar. Believing this to be Aizen`s doing, Captain Hitsugaya decides to hold off on Shota`s soul burial to further investigate the situation. Meanwhile, the Mock Arrancar has returned and seems to be multiplying.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"舞い降りた闇の使者! 増殖する悪意\"},{\"title\":\"Invisible Enemy! Hitsugaya`s Merciless Decision\",\"number\":130,\"airDate\":\"2007-06-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hitsugaya and his advanced troops learn that Shota`s little sister Yui was the Mock Arrancar`s first victim. Shota abandoned Yui out of fear and blames himself for the entire incident. Rangiku finds it suspicious that Yui appears to be fine despite having been attacked by an Arrancar. Meanwhile, Hitsugaya is in pursuit of the Mock Arrancar within the residential district when he encounters an injured soul.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"見えない敵! 日番谷, 非情な決断\"},{\"title\":\"Rangiku`s Tears, the Sorrowful Parting of Brother and Sister\",\"number\":131,\"airDate\":\"2007-06-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"It is revealed that the Mock Arrancar gained an explosive amount of strength when it devoured Yui and has reanimated her soul to use her as bait to lure and attack human souls. While the Mock Arrancar attempts to absorb Shota`s soul, it is met with a counterstrike from Rangiku. Cornered, the Mock Arrancar continues to multiply in order to better its odds against the highly skilled advance troops.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"乱菊の涙, 哀しき兄妹の別れ\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya, Karin and Soccer Ball\",\"number\":132,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When a bullying group of middle school students refuse to give up the soccer field, Karin Kurosaki fearlessly agrees to lead her reluctant friends into a soccer match against the upperclassmen. The team that wins the game will gain the right to use the field while the losing team will have to eat the grass. With a hopeless squad of cowards on her team, Karin recruits the help of Soul Reaper Captain Toshiro Hitsugaya, who surprisingly knows a thing or two about soccer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷と夏梨とサッカーボール\"},{\"title\":\"Ikkaku`s Hot-Blooded Kendo Tale\",\"number\":133,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Karakura First High School`s kendo team is ambushed, and the captain and all of the main members are seriously injured. The injured team members are worried they`ll have to pull out of the regional tournament the following month, but the student body president, Kego`s sister Mizuho, suggests that they have a practice match against their attackers. With all the regulars injured, however, only the freshmen are left. Mizuho asks Ikkaku to train the remaining team members, and for some reason Ikkaku accepts the request. And so begins Ikkaku`s training from hell.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一角, 熱血剣道物語\"},{\"title\":\"The Beautiful Patissier, Yumichika!\",\"number\":134,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Head Captain orders Mayuri Kurotsuchi to simplify the procedures to perform Gentei Kaijo, a restriction release for the Spiritual Pressure of the Advance Troops while in the World of the Living. Rin Tsubokura of the Department of Research and Development is sent to conduct some research in the World of the Living. While in the World of the Living, Rin is escorted by Hanataro Yamada and Yumichika Ayasegawa. In the middle of Rin`s research, they come across a lone soul in front of a cake shop.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"美しきパティシエ, 弓親!\"},{\"title\":\"Kon is Deceived! Rangiku on the Lookout..\",\"number\":135,\"airDate\":\"2007-07-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kon, lonely and bored due to Rukia`s and Orihime`s absence, decides to pay a visit to Rangiku. While walking near the river, Rangiku and Kon witness a young girl fall off a bridge when she tries to save her stuffed animal. In order to rescue the girl, Miyuki, Rangiku takes Kon`s soul candy out of his body and throws it into the mouth of the stuffed animal that Miyuki dropped. Kon finds that his duties as the girl`s savior are a little more than he bargained for.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"はかられた, コン! 乱菊は見ていた..\"},{\"title\":\"Civil War in Hueco Mondo! Ulquiorra`s Death\",\"number\":136,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Trouble is brewing in Las Noches, Aizen`s palace in the Hollow realm, Hueco Mundo. One of the Arrancars, Patras, rebels against Aizen and tries to steal the Hogyoku. Ulquiorra realizes what Patras is up to, but he is defeated when he is caught off-guard by Menis and Aldegor, who assist Patros in his rebellion. Upon obtaining the Hogyoku, the three go to the World of the Living, where they head to Urahara`s shop in order to find Kisuke Urahara, the creator of the Hogyoku.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウェコムンドの内乱! ウルキオラの死\"},{\"title\":\"Battle of Bad Faith, Aizen`s Trap\",\"number\":137,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Renji`s fight with Patras continues as it destroys Urahara`s shop and parts of Karakura Town. Repeatedly overpowered by Patras`s attacks, Renji leads the Arrancar into Urahara`s underground training facility where he can safely use his Bankai. Meanwhile, Hitsugaya and the others engage Menis and Aldegor while the Arrancars are in their released state.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪意の戦い, 藍染の罠\"},{\"title\":\"Second Move of Hueco Mundo! Hitsugaya vs Yammy\",\"number\":138,\"airDate\":\"2007-08-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"There are only a few months left until the showdown with the Arrancars. Ichigo continues to train with the Visoreds, but the amount of time in which he can remain Hollowfied hasn`t increased by much. In the Soul Society, Rukia and Orihime have also been undergoing rigorous training. Ukitake happily watches the two and is pleased that Rukia finally has friends. Sosuke Aizen may have plans to cut their training short as he calls on his Espada.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウェコムンド再動! 日番谷vsヤミー\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo vs Grimmjow, 11 Seconds Battle!\",\"number\":139,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Arrancars suddenly appear in the World of the Living. Yammy, Luppi, Grimmjow, and Wonderweiss are confronted by Hitsugaya`s advance troops and Ichigo. Ichigo fights Grimmjow and immediately uses his Bankai. Meanwhile, Luppi, the newest Espada Number Six, takes on Hitsugaya and his troops by himself. He releases his Zanpakuto and knocks down Hitsugaya with the tremendous force of his eight tentacles. His tentacles then set their sights on Rangiku, Ikkaku, and Yumichika.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護VSグリムジョー, 11秒の戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"Ulquiorra`s Scheme, the Moment When the Sun Sets\",\"number\":140,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hitsugaya`s advance troops continue to fight the Arrancars who appeared in Karakura Town. Urahara shows up to help. He dodges Wonderweiss, but Yammy hits him with a flurry of Bala attacks. Meanwhile, Rangiku, Ikkaku and Yumichika are having trouble fighting Espada Number Six, Luppi, who has released his zanpakuto. And on the other side of town Ichigo has cornered Grimmjow.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"策謀のウルキオラ, 太陽が沈む時\"},{\"title\":\"Goodbye..., Kurosaki\",\"number\":141,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends manage to drive away Grimmjow and the other Arrancars. But behind the scenes, Aizen orders Ulquiorra to bring Orihime to Hueco Mundo. Orihime agrees to go in exchange for the safety of her friends. She is given a twelve-hour reprieve and is allowed to say her farewells to only one person. Orihime prepares herself and leaves her room to say goodbye to the one person she has in mind. Meanwhile, Hitsugaya and the others are recovering from the injuries they received from their fight with the Arrancars.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さよなら..., 黒崎くん\"},{\"title\":\"Strict Order! The Forbidden Rescue of Inoue Orihime\",\"number\":142,\"airDate\":\"2007-09-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo awakens to realize that the serious injuries he received from Grimmjow`s attack have completely healed. He senses that Orihime came to his room from the traces of Spiritual Pressure that she left behind. Hitsugaya comes to get Ichigo, and they head to Orihime`s room. Ichigo senses that something is odd when he sees Rukia and the others gathered there. A transmission comes in from the Soul Society and Captain Ukitake appears on the monitor. He tells them the terrifying truth: that Orihime is with the Arrancars and may already be dead.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"厳命! 井上織姫ノ救出ヲ禁ズ\"},{\"title\":\"Revival of Grimmjow\",\"number\":143,\"airDate\":\"2007-10-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orihime has been kidnapped by Sosuke Aizen and the Arrancars. Ichigo decides to go to Hueco Mundo in order to save her. He visits Urahara`s shop and finds Uryu and Chad waiting for him. They have both finished their training and are ready to join Ichigo in the rescue of Orihime. Meanwhile, in Hueco Mundo, Orihime is brought before Aizen in his palace, Las Noches.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"復活のグリムジョー\"},{\"title\":\"Ishida, Chad, the Quickening of a New Power\",\"number\":144,\"airDate\":\"2007-10-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, Uryu, and Chad charge through the Garganta and into Hueco Mundo. There, they find themselves in a large corridor. They set off deeper into the building to search for Orihime, but as they move further down the corridor they find many traps left for them by the Arrancars.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石田・チャド, 新しき力の胎動\"},{\"title\":\"The Espada Gather! Aizen`s Royal Assembly\",\"number\":145,\"airDate\":\"2007-10-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends defeat the Arrancars Iceringer and Demora, whom they meet in underground corridor 22. They escape the underground just as it begins to crumble and come out onto the surface of Hueco Mundo. It is a world of night and white sand. They immediately find Aizen`s palace, Las Noches, and are awed by its size. Meanwhile, Aizen calls a meeting with all of the Espada.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"エスパーダ集結! 藍染の御前会議\"},{\"title\":\"Her Name is Nel! The Appearance of the Strange Arrancar\",\"number\":146,\"airDate\":\"2007-10-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends save a girl who is being attacked by mysterious Arrancars. The girl is also an Arrancar, named Nel, and as it turns out, she was only playing tag with her Arrancar friends, Pesche and Dondochakka. Nel and her friends are oddly cheery, but when they realize that Ichigo is a Soul Reaper, they worry that Aizen will scold them for letting their enemies roam freely.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"その名はネル! 不思議なアランカル登場\"},{\"title\":\"The Forest of Menos! The Search for the Missing Rukia\",\"number\":147,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In a second attempt to defeat Runuganga, the Guardian of the White Sands, Rukia uses Sodenoshirayuki, but her attack backfires when she accidentally stabs Bawabawa in the back. Startled by his injury, Bawabawa begins flailing and sends Rukia flying through the air. Ichigo and his friends are swallowed by the desert of Hueco Mundo and fall into the Menos Forest, home of the Menos.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"メノスの森! 消えたルキアを探せ!\"},{\"title\":\"Ashido, the Shinigami Who Came from the Past\",\"number\":148,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends have fallen into the Menos Forest. They fight off attacks from Gillians while they look for Rukia and Nel, who have been separated from the group. Rukia is hiding out of harm`s way with a mysterious Soul Reaper named Ashido, and Nel was taken away by a group of Hollows. Just as Rukia and Ashido notice a drop in Ichigo`s Spiritual Pressure, they sense something else in the forest approaching.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"アシド, 過去から来た死神\"},{\"title\":\"Through the Crumbling Forest, a Million Menos\",\"number\":149,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ashido and Rukia continue to battle Pequenos, one of the Adjuchas who controls the Menos Forest. Pequenos attacks at full strength to try to end the long-shared enmity between him and Ashido. Meanwhile, Ichigo, Chad, Uryu, and Renji follow Nel and her friends` Spiritual Pressure to the depths of the Menos Forest. They find that Nel and her friends have been captured. At that moment, they are surrounded by a tremendous number of Gillians.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"崩れ行く森, 百万のメノス\"},{\"title\":\"Oath! Back Here Alive Again\",\"number\":150,\"airDate\":\"2007-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends arrive at Las Noches, Aizen`s stronghold, where they break through a wall and charge into the palace. Ichigo tries to leave Nel behind, but she follows Ichigo into the palace and cries as she chases after him. At first Ichigo ignores her, but when he finally gives in, Nel suddenly disappears. In the darkness, Ichigo and his friends search the area where they last heard Nel`s voice and find a hole that leads underground.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"誓い! 再び生きてこの場所へ\"},{\"title\":\"The Raging Storm! Encounter with the Dancing Arrancar\",\"number\":151,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, Uryu, Chad, Rukia, and Renji go their separate ways down the corridors of Las Noches and vow to safely reunite. Ichigo heads down a pathway on his own, but he is followed by Nel. He has no choice but to allow her to join him in order to keep her safe. Suddenly, he senses someone`s Spiritual Pressure. An Arrancar named Dordoni stands in Ichigo and Nel`s way. Dordoni is Espada Number 103 and doesn`t appear to be very strong. Ichigo unenthusiastically accepts his challenge.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"吹き荒れる暴風! 踊るアランカルとの遭遇\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Strikes Back! This is my Bankai\",\"number\":152,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Dordoni the Arrancar is a Privaron Espada, a former Espada. Ichigo underestimates his strength and is quickly driven into a corner when Dordoni releases his Zanpakuto. Dordoni pushes Ichigo and demands to see his Bankai, but Ichigo refuses. He wants to fight Dordoni as he is in order to conserve his strength. Dordoni loses his temper and releases the blast of a massive Cero at Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護反撃! こいつが俺の卍解だ\"},{\"title\":\"The Devilish Research! Szayel Aporro`s Plan\",\"number\":153,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Dordoni makes a final attempt to win his battle, but he is defeated by a Hollowfied Ichigo. As Ichigo and Nel continue on their way to Las Noches, the Exequias, Hueco Mundo`s execution squad, arrive to finish off Ichigo. Meanwhile, Uryu and Chad also move into the Privaron Espada area and begin fierce battles with triple-digit Arrancars.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪魔の研究! ザエルアポロの企み\"},{\"title\":\"Rukia and Kaien, the Sorrowful Reunion\",\"number\":154,\"airDate\":\"2007-12-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the depths of Las Noches, Rukia encounters Ninth Espada Aaroniero Arruruerie in an area with a blue sky. Aaroniero lures Rukia into a room and removes his mask. Underneath his mask is the face of Kaien Shiba, the former Thirteenth Squad Lieutenant who is supposed to be dead. Rukia is confused, but Kaien talks with her as if nothing happened. Kaien explains that because of the ability of the Hollow that took control of him right before he died, he was thrust into Hueco Mundo, where he was reborn.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキアと海燕, 哀しみの再会\"},{\"title\":\"Rukia Retaliates! Release the Desperate Kidou\",\"number\":155,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia is angered when Kaien tells her to hand over her friends in return for letting her go and is convinced that this Kaien is a fake. She attacks Kaien with every technique she knows, but he dodges them all. Kaien claims that he knows all about Rukia`s ability because he`s the real Kaien. When he releases his Zanpakuto, Nejibana, Rukia struggles to believe that this person could actually be her former lieutenant.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ルキア反撃! 決死の鬼道を放て\"},{\"title\":\"Ishida & Pesshe, the United Attack of Friendship\",\"number\":156,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu is having a tough time fighting against Privaron Espada Cirucci, whose whip attacks are ever changing. Pesche, who has come looking for Nel, stumbles upon Uryu`s fight with Cirucci instead. Pesche attempts to run away in terror but is distracted when his eye catches the miniskirt of Cirucci who is standing on a high pillar.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石田&ペッシェ, 友情の合体攻撃\"},{\"title\":\"Ishida`s Trump Card, Seele Schneider\",\"number\":157,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Pesche`s unusual ability allows Uryu to damage Cirucci. Cirucci releases her Zanpakuto and attacks the two until she has them cornered. Uryu uses Seeleschneider, the only bladed Quincy weapon, to counter her attacks as they get closer and closer. With Seeleschneider Uryu is able to cut through Cirucci`s feathers. Figuring that her attacks will no longer that work against Uryu, Cirucci does something unexpected\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石田の切り札, 魂を切り裂くもの\"},{\"title\":\"Right Arm of the Giant, Left Arm of the Devil\",\"number\":158,\"airDate\":\"2008-01-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chad faces the Privaron Espada Gantenbainne and survives many of his fierce attacks. Chad reveals the power of his right arm, Brazo Derecho Del Gigante. Ever since he entered Hueco Mundo, Chad has sensed that his powers are closer to that of a Hollow`s rather than a Soul Reaper or a Quincy. Cornered, Gantenbainne releases his Zanpakuto to defend against Chad`s powerful attacks.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨人の右腕, 悪魔の左腕\"},{\"title\":\"Sado Yasutora Dies! Orihime`s Tears\",\"number\":159,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nnoitra, one of the Espada, suddenly appears and defeats Chad in a single strike. Ichigo, Uryu, and Renji sense Chad`s Spiritual Pressure grow weaker, but they are too far away to help him. Orihime, who is still being held by the Arrancars, also senses Chad`s Spiritual Pressure. At that moment, Ulquiorra enters Orihime`s room and informs her that her friends will soon perish.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"茶渡泰虎死す! 織姫の涙\"},{\"title\":\"Testament, Your Heart is Right Here...\",\"number\":160,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aaroniero has the ability to utilize the Spiritual Pressure of the Hollows that he devours. He devoured the body of the Hollow Metastacia that fused itself with Lieutenant Kaien Shiba before it died. Now he uses his power to gain its memory and abilities. Rukia, who is the Soul Reaper responsible for bringing down Metastacia while it was possessing Kaien`s body, is shocked to see her former lieutenant before her. As Aaroniero releases his Zanpakuto, Rukia struggles to find the will to defend against his attacks\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"遺言, 心は此処に...\"},{\"title\":\"The Cruel Arrancar, Ulquiorra`s Provocation\",\"number\":161,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Renji meets Espada Number Eight, Szayel Aporro Grantz. Renji attempts to use his Bankai but fails because of restrictions that Szayel Aporro has placed on the room they are in that limit Renji`s power. Szayel Aporro has extensive information on Renji`s abilities. He plans to capture Renji unharmed so he can conduct further research on him. Meanwhile, all of the Espada in Las Noches are informed that Rukia defeated Espada Number Nine, Aaroniero.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"残酷な破面, ウルキオラの挑発\"},{\"title\":\"Szayel Aporro Laughs, The Net Trapping Renji is Complete\",\"number\":162,\"airDate\":\"2008-02-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Ulquiorra begin to fight in the depths of Las Noches. Ichigo fights Ulquiorra at full power right from the start, using his Bankai and even his Hollowfication. Ulquiorra is overwhelmed by his great strength, but strategically retaliates when Ichigo removes his Hollow`s mask. Meanwhile, Renji`s Bankai is sealed away as he fights Szayel Aporro. Szayel Aporro continues to have a home-field advantage as he effortlessly blocks Renji`s attacks and calls on some of his subordinates\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"笑うザエルアポロ, 恋次包囲網完成\"},{\"title\":\"Shinigami and Quincy, the Battle with Madness\",\"number\":163,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lolly and Menoly are jealous that Aizen is treating Orihime well, so they go to Orihime`s room to harass her. Orihime tries to stay strong, but they are relentless. At that moment, Grimmjow comes to Orihime`s room. Meanwhile, Uryu comes to help Renji, and joins the fight against Szayel Aporro. Uryu takes advantage of an opening and pierces Szayel Aporro with Seeleschneider`s blade. Szayel Aporro collapses, but Uryu is shocked when Seeleschneider suddenly disappears.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神とクインシー, 狂気との戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Ishida`s Strategy, the 20-second Offense and Defense\",\"number\":164,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Szayel Aporro has analyzed Uryu`s and Renji`s Spiritual Pressures and has sealed away most of their abilities. The two decide to work together. Uryu says that he has a plan if Renji can stall Szayel Aporro for twenty seconds. Renji agrees and charges in, but Szayel Aporro easily deflects Zabimaru`s attacks. Meanwhile, Ichigo has been defeated by Ulquiorra and has lost consciousness.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"石田の作戦! 攻防の20秒\"},{\"title\":\"The Murderous Intent Boils! The Joyful Grimmjow\",\"number\":165,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Grimmjow takes Orihime without permission and forces her to heal Ichigo. He wants to settle things with Ichigo while he`s in his best condition. But before Ichigo`s wounds heal, Ulquiorra comes when he realizes what`s going on. Ulquiorra stops Ichigo`s healing and demands that Grimmjow hand Orihime over to him. Grimmjow refuses and attacks Ulquiorra. The clashing Spiritual Pressures of the two Espada shake Las Noches.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"殺意沸騰! 歓喜のグリムジョー\"},{\"title\":\"Desperate Effort VS Desperate Effort! The Hollowized Ichigo\",\"number\":166,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A wild battle begins between Ichigo and Grimmjow. As swords and Spiritual Pressures clash, Grimmjow unleashes his strongest Cero, the Gran Rey Cero. Orihime and Nel are about to be caught in the attack, so Ichigo Hollowfies in order to save them. Grimmjow shouts for joy when faced with Ichigo`s power. He releases his Zanpakuto and shows his most powerful form. Orihime watches as the battle rages on. She becomes frightened when she compares Ichigo`s ominous Spiritual Pressure to that of her brother who became a Hollow.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死力VS死力! ホロウ化した一護\"},{\"title\":\"The Moment of Conclusion, the End of Grimmjow\",\"number\":167,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo hits Grimmjow with a mighty blow. Grimmjow is about to collapse, but he grabs Zangetsu and pulls himself up. He begins to remember his time as an Adjucha, a Hollow that has an extreme hunger for souls. They continue to obsessively devour souls until they reach the level of Gillians, and then finally they become Adjuchas. But those who become Adjuchas have the fear of degenerating. If they don`t continue to consume Hollows, they will degenerate into Gillians. Grimmjow continues to attack his fellow Hollows until he meets an interesting band of Adjuchas.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決着の時, グリムジョーの最後\"},{\"title\":\"The New Captain Appears! His name is Amagai Shuusuke\",\"number\":168,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A new captain joins Squad 3, taking the place of the rebel Gin Ichimaru. His name is Shusuke Amagai.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新隊長登場! その名は天貝繍助\"},{\"title\":\"New Development, the Dangerous Transfer Student Appears!\",\"number\":169,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the middle of the night, a strange Senkaimon opens in Karakura Town, and a mysterious team of three arrives in the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新展開, 危険な転校生現る!\"},{\"title\":\"Desperate Struggle Under the Moonlit Night, the Mysterious Assassin and Zanpakutou\",\"number\":170,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A mysterious team of three transfers into Ichigo’s class. Their names are Rurichiyo Kasumiohji, Kenryu, and Enryu. Rurichiyo acts like a princess, and Kenryu and Enryu obsessively guard her surroundings.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月夜の死闘, 謎の刺客と斬魄刀\"},{\"title\":\"Kenryuu, the Profusion of Blooming Crimson Flowers\",\"number\":171,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Rukia assume the responsibility of being Rurichiyo’s bodyguard. It is Rurichiyo’s first time in the World of the Living, and she asks Ichigo to teach her about everything she sees.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"犬龍, 咲き乱れる紅の華\"},{\"title\":\"Kibune Goes to War! The Violent Wind that Rages\",\"number\":172,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Since welcoming Shusuke Amagai as the new captain, Squad 3 has been hard at work. But the duties Shusuke assigns them are tasks that one couldn’t imagine a Soul Reaper doing.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"貴船出陣! 吹き荒れる烈風\"},{\"title\":\"The Appearance of the Great Evil! The Darkness in the House of Kasumiooji\",\"number\":173,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"One morning, Rurichiyo suddenly disappears. Kenryu finds some indication that leads him to believe that she used the Kasumiohji Clan’s private Senkaimon to return to the Soul Society.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"巨悪の登場! 霞大路家の闇\"},{\"title\":\"Captured Ichigo, Shatter the Mirror`s Barrier!\",\"number\":174,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo returns to the World of the Living, and he draws up a countermeasure at Kisuke Urahara’s shop. When everyone leaves Urahara’s shop, they come across Hanza Nukui, the head of an assassination squad.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"囚われた一護, 鏡の結界を破れ!\"},{\"title\":\"The Revenging Assassin, Ichigo is Targeted\",\"number\":175,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hanza Nukui has misjudged the power of Ichigo and his friends, and has failed to assassinate Rurichiyo. He forms a unit of assassins, armed with powerful Bakkouto swords, and prepares to go back to the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"復讐の刺客, 狙われた一護\"},{\"title\":\"Mystery! The Sword-Consuming Assassin\",\"number\":176,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hanza Nukui and his team of assassins, armed with Bakkoutos, arrive in the World of the Living, and they challenge Ichigo and the others to fight. Jinnai Douko appears before Rurichiyo wielding a Bakkouto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怪奇! 刀を喰う暗殺者\"},{\"title\":\"The Reversal of Rukia, the Rampaging Blade\",\"number\":177,\"airDate\":\"2008-06-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The respective battles of Rukia, Uryu, and Chad continue. Jinnai Douko becomes one with his Bakkouto, Retsurai, and keeps attacking. Rukia has a tough battle against Jinnai, whose whole body transforms into a weapon.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"逆転のルキア! 暴走する刀\"},{\"title\":\"The Nightmare Which is Shown, Ichigo`s Inside the Mirror\",\"number\":178,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hanza Nukui uses his Bakkouto, Saiga’s weak point, to act as a trap for Ichigo. Ichigo ends up getting caught in Hanza’s scheme, an expanse of mirrors. The mirrors take the memories of the captive and turn them into nightmares.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"見せられた悪夢, 鏡の中の一護\"},{\"title\":\"Confrontation?! Amagai vs. Gotei 13\",\"number\":179,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At a captain’s meeting in the Soul Society, Shusuke Amagai proposes to the Thirteen Court Guard Squads that they train directly with the squads.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"対立!? 天貝VS護廷十三隊\"},{\"title\":\"The Princess` Decision, the Sorrowful Bride\",\"number\":180,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends have narrowly escaped Hanza Nukui’s team’s attacks. But Uryu and Chad have been inundated with the Spirit Energy of Bakkoutos, and Orihime’s healing power doesn’t seem to be working.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"姫の決意, 哀しき花嫁\"},{\"title\":\"The 2nd Division Sorties! Ichigo is Surrounded\",\"number\":181,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rurichiyo has gone back to the Soul Society to take back control of the Kasumiohji Clan. Ichigo, Rukia, Kenryu, and Enryu follow her through the Senkaimon, and they barge in on Rurichiyo and Shu’s wedding at the Kasumiohji palace.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"二番隊出撃! 包囲された一護\"},{\"title\":\"Amagai`s True Strength, the Released Zanpakutou!\",\"number\":182,\"airDate\":\"2008-07-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Rukia are being chased down by the Thirteen Court Guard Squads after sabotaging Rurichiyo and Shu’s wedding and taking Shu hostage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"天貝の実力, 斬魄刀解放!\"},{\"title\":\"The Darkness Which Moves! Kibune`s True Colors\",\"number\":183,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After Shu Kannogi tearfully tells Shusuke Amagai how he feels, Shusuke loses his feelings of ill will towards Ichigo and instead decides to help in their search for Rurichiyo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"動き出した闇! 貴船(きぶね)の正体\"},{\"title\":\"Kira and Kibune, Offense and Defense of 3rd Division\",\"number\":184,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers stop chasing after Ichigo for the time being and focus on restoring order in the Seireitei.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"吉良と貴船, 三番隊の攻防\"},{\"title\":\"Ice and Flame! Fierce Fight of Amagai vs. Hitsugaya\",\"number\":185,\"airDate\":\"2008-08-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The intense battle between Izuru Kira and Makoto Kibune continues at Squad Three’s training facility.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"氷と炎! 天貝VS日番谷の激闘\"},{\"title\":\"Sortie Orders! Suppress the House of Kasumiooji\",\"number\":186,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Head Captain’s command, all the Soul Reapers of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads break into the Kasumiohji Clan’s palace at once.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"出撃指令! 霞大路家を制圧せよ\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Rages! The Assassin`s Secret\",\"number\":187,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle at the Kasumiohji Clan’s palace between the Thirteen Court Guard Squads and the Kasumiohji Clan’s assassins continues.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護激怒! 暗殺者の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Duel! Amagai vs. Ichigo\",\"number\":188,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The chaos in the Kasumiohji Clan was all a scheme formulated by Shusuke Amagai. Shusuke joined the Thirteen Court Guard Squads in order to avenge his father’s death at the hands of Head Captain Yamamoto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決闘! 天貝VS一護\"},{\"title\":\"The Fallen Shinigami`s Pride\",\"number\":189,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shusuke Amagai wields both a Bakkouto, which seals the powers of Soul Reapers, and his Bankai, Raika Gouenkaku. Ichigo defends against Shusuke`s Bankai while Hollowfied and counterattacks with his most powerful Getsugatensho.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"堕ちた死神の誇り\"},{\"title\":\"Hueco Mundo Chapter, Restart!\",\"number\":190,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Hueco Mundo Arc, which was put on hold for the New Captain Shusuke Amagai Arc, resumes.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ウェコムンド編, 再開!\"},{\"title\":\"Szayel Aporro`s Theater\",\"number\":191,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu and Renji thought they had escaped, but they find themselves back at Szayelaporro`s palace.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恐宴, ザエルアポロ劇場\"},{\"title\":\"The Secret of Nel\",\"number\":192,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After finding Nel hiding in the shadow of a rock, Nnoitora tells Ichigo`s group that Nel is actually a former Espada.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ネルの秘密, 巨乳美女参戦!?\"},{\"title\":\"The Irresistable, Puppet Show of Terror\",\"number\":193,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu and Renji continue fighting their clones. But no matter how many times they beat them, the clones turn back into liquid, multiply, and revive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"抵抗不能, 恐怖の人形劇\"},{\"title\":\"Neliel`s Past\",\"number\":194,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nnoitora and Nelliel continue to battle. They are nearly equal in strength. The two of them used to fight side by side as fellow Espadas.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ネリエルの過去\"},{\"title\":\"Pesche`s Seriousness\",\"number\":195,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nelliel regains her memory, and Pesche and Dondochakka realize that she is going to give her all in the battle against Nnoitora. In order to go fight with Nelliel, Pesche and Dondochakka summon all their strength.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ペッシェの本気\"},{\"title\":\"The Strongest Shinigami Army Appears\",\"number\":196,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Just when Nelliel and Nnoitora`s battle is about to come to an end, something unexpected happens to Nelliel`s body. Ichigo`s group find themselves in a sticky situation yet again.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最強死神軍団登場\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya`s Bankai, the Quiet Anger\",\"number\":197,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Byakuya visits Rukia, who is unconscious after being injured in the battle against Aaroniero Arruruerie. Zommari Rureaux, Espada Number 7, happens to be there, attempting to finish her off.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉卍解, 静かなる怒り\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Scientists, Mayuri`s Trap\",\"number\":198,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Zommari`s technique, \\\"Amor,\\\" takes control over anything its eyes gaze upon. He uses this power to control Rukia`s body and use her as a shield.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"2人の科学者, マユリの罠\"},{\"title\":\"The Resurrecting Szayel Aporro\",\"number\":199,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Szayelaporro is exasperated when his powers don`t work at all against Mayuri Kurotsuchi, and he ends up being enveloped by Mayuri`s Konjiki Ashisogijizo. Just then, something happens to Nemu, who was being held hostage.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"蘇るザエルアポロ\"},{\"title\":\"Nnoitra is Cut Down\",\"number\":200,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Szayelaporro used his prisoner Nemu as a medium to come back to life. However, Nemu`s body is permeated with the new medicine that Mayuri developed. Szayelaporro experiences the dreadful effects of the medicine himself.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ノイトラを斬れ\"},{\"title\":\"Nnoitra Releases! The Multiplying Arms\",\"number\":201,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kenpachi goes after Nnoitora`s eye and pierces his eye patch, but the eye patch was hiding a dreadful secret.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ノイトラ解放! 増殖した腕\"},{\"title\":\"Fierce Fighting Conclusion! Who`s the Strongest\",\"number\":202,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Kenpachi`s eye patch comes off, releasing his Spiritual Pressure and true strength, Nnoitora invokes his sword attack, Santa Teresa.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激闘決着! 最強は誰だ\"},{\"title\":\"Aizen vs. Shinigami\",\"number\":203,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nnoitora has never shown any mercy to his opponents, and he has always finished them off. Nnoitora`s reason for fighting has always been purely to fight. He has been fighting and becoming stronger, hoping to someday die in battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"藍染VS死神\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo`s Seppuku Persuasion Strategy\",\"number\":204,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rurichiyo Kasumiohji, who supposedly became the head of the family, goes off to the World of the Living by herself after getting in a fight with Kenryu.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護の切腹説得作戦\"},{\"title\":\"Thump! The Football Tournament of Hollows\",\"number\":205,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rurichiyo and Kenryu`s fight was over how to revitalize the Kasumiohji Clan. Rurichiyo is concerned about the low spirits of her people, and she wants to host a soccer tournament.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ドキ! 虚だらけの蹴鞠大会\"},{\"title\":\"The Past Chapter Begins! The Truth from 110 Years Ago\",\"number\":206,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"In the Soul Society 110 years ago, the Thirteen Court Guard Squads are made up of unfamiliar faces. The captain of Squad Five is the masked Visored, Shinji Hirako who currently resides in the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"過去編開始! 110年前の真実\"},{\"title\":\"12th Division`s New Captain, Urahara Kisuke\",\"number\":207,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kisuke Urahara replaces the newly promoted Kirio Hikifune as captain of Squad Twelve. Hiyori Sarugaki, lieutenant of Squad Twelve, cannot hide her dissatisfaction with the new captain.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"十二番隊新隊長, 浦原喜助\"},{\"title\":\"Aizen and the Boy Genius\",\"number\":208,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kisuke takes Hiyori to the Special underground Confinement Unit inside the Squad Two barracks. Nicknamed the Maggot`s Nest, this place imprisons enlisted Thirteen Court Guard Squad members whose beliefs or actions have been deemed dangerous.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"藍染と天才少年\"},{\"title\":\"Muguruma`s 9th Division, Sets Out\",\"number\":209,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nine years have passed since Kisuke Urahara was appointed captain of Squad Twelve. Bizarre deaths start to occur in the Rukon District where people disappear, leaving only their clothes behind.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"六車九番隊, 出動せよ\"},{\"title\":\"Hiyori Dies? The Beginning of Tragedy\",\"number\":210,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kensei Muguruma`s and Mashiro Kuna`s Spiritual Pressure disappears. The Seireitei deems this a dire situation. Kisuke Urahara, who sent Hiyori to Squad Nine, volunteers to go to the scene of their disappearance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ひよ里死す? 悲劇の始まり\"},{\"title\":\"Betrayal! Aizen`s Secret Maneuvers\",\"number\":211,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At Squad Nine`s camp, Shinji Hirako and the others run into Kensei Muguruma, who is donning a strange mask. Kensei starts to attack them, and he is too powerful to stop even with all of them combined.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切り! 暗躍の藍染\"},{\"title\":\"Rescue Hirako! Aizen vs. Urahara\",\"number\":212,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sosuke Aizen suddenly appears in front of Shinji Hirako and the others. He draws his sword on Shinji, who is agonized by his Hollow transformation and cannot move his body at will.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"平子を救え! 藍染VS浦原\"},{\"title\":\"The Karakurizer is Born\",\"number\":213,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and his friends leave Karakura Town with the intent of bringing Orihime back, and they continue fighting in Hueco Mundo. Nevertheless, Hollows continue to appear in the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カラクライザー誕生\"},{\"title\":\"Karakuraizer`s Last Day\",\"number\":214,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kisuke Urahara has forced Kon to transform into Konso Cop Karakurizer. As Karakurizer, Kon has some powerful allies.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"カラクライザー最後の日\"},{\"title\":\"Defend Karakura Town! Entire Appearance of the Shinigami\",\"number\":215,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Sosuke Aizen brings Kaname Tosen, Gin Ichimaru, and the Espadas Stark, Barragan, and Halibel to the World of the Living on a mission to destroy Karakura Town. The Espadas stand before the Thirteen Court Guard Squads.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"空座町を護れ! 死神総登場\"},{\"title\":\"Elite! The Four Shinigami\",\"number\":216,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Head Captain expected the battle to take place in Karakura Town, so he fights to keep it from being destroyed. He places pillars in four corners of the town to switch the real Karakura Town with a replica that was made in the Soul Society.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"精鋭! 四人の死神\"},{\"title\":\"Beautiful Warrior Charlotte\",\"number\":217,\"airDate\":\"2009-04-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shuhei, Ikkaku, Yumichika, and Izuru start fighting against the Fracci贸nes that Barragan deployed.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"美しき戦士シャルロッテ\"},{\"title\":\"Kira, the Battle Within Despair\",\"number\":218,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yumichika is trapped inside Chuhlhourne’s briar of darkness. Learning he cannot be seen from the outside world, Yumichika unveils his Zanpakuto’s true power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"吉良, 絶望の中での戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Hisagi`s Shikai! The Name is...\",\"number\":219,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shuhei Hisagi battles Findorr Calius, who has increased his strength level equal to that of a squad lieutenant by shattering his own mask. Shuhei, overwhelmed by the enemy’s power, is forced to stay on the defensive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"檜佐木始解! その名は...\"},{\"title\":\"Ikkaku Falls! The Shinigami`s Crisis\",\"number\":220,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shuhei, Izuru, Yumichika, and Ikkaku fight to guard the four pillars used to switch the real Karakura Town with a fake one.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一角倒れる! 死神の危機\"},{\"title\":\"The Full Showdown! Shinigami vs. Espada\",\"number\":221,\"airDate\":\"2009-05-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers succeed in defending the four pillars from being destroyed, preventing the real Karakura Town from returning to the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全面対決!死神VS十刃\"},{\"title\":\"The Most Evil Tag!? Soi Fon & Oomaeda\",\"number\":222,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Soi Fon and Marechiyo Omaeda are to take on Ggio and Nirgge. Soi Fon confidently goes after Ggio, but Ggio puts up a good fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最凶タッグ!? 砕蜂 & 大前田\"},{\"title\":\"A Miraculous Body! Ggio Releases\",\"number\":223,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ggio, who released his Hollow power, is overpowering Soi Fon. Marechiyo Omaeda realizes that Soi Fon is in a dire situation and comes to help her.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"驚異の肉体!ジオ解放\"},{\"title\":\"3 vs. 1 Battle! Rangiku`s Crisis\",\"number\":224,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rangiku battles Halibel’s three Fracciónes, Apache, Mila Rose, and Sun-Sun. She attacks with her Haineko, but even that is not very effective against the three opponents.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"3 VS 1の戦闘! ピンチの乱菊\"},{\"title\":\"All Vice-Captains Annihilated! The Terrifying Demonic Beast\",\"number\":225,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Apache, Mila Rose, and Sun-Sun release their Resurrección forms. In addition, they combine their left arms to create a mysterious monster called Ayon.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"副隊長全滅! 恐怖の妖獣\"},{\"title\":\"Fierce Fighting Concludes? Towards a New Battle!\",\"number\":226,\"airDate\":\"2009-06-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers are defeated one after another at the hands of Ayon. Seeing this, Head Captain Genryusai Yamamoto decides to get involved.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激闘終結? 新たなる戦いへ!\"},{\"title\":\"Wonderful Error\",\"number\":227,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Mizuiro starts at Karakura First High School without any great expectations or ambitions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ワンダフル・エラー\"},{\"title\":\"Summer! Sea! Swimsuit Festival!!\",\"number\":228,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rangiku and the members of the Women’s Soul Reaper Association take a relaxing trip to a beach in the World of the Living. All the women are excited about wearing bathing suits that they have picked out for the occasion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"夏だ! 海だ! 水着祭!!\"},{\"title\":\"The Rug Shinigami is Born!\",\"number\":229,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ikkaku and Yumichika are sent after a Hollow that ran away to the World of the Living. They have no prearranged lodging, so they decide to stay at the Asano family house.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ヅラ死神誕生!\"},{\"title\":\"The Materialization of Zanpakutou\",\"number\":230,\"airDate\":\"2009-07-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A mysterious man who calls himself \\\"Muramasa\\\" appears in the Seireitei to declare war against the Soul Reapers. Using his powers, Muramasa gives physical form to the Zanpakuto and liberates them from the captains and lieutenants of the 13 Court Guard Squads.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"斬魄刀実体化\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya, Disappearing With the Cherry Blossoms\",\"number\":231,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having sustained severe injuries in battle, Rukia escapes to the World of the Living and is saved by Ichigo. A mysterious woman then arrives through the Senkaimon and proceeds to attack the two using the same Zanpakuto as Rukia.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉, 桜と共に消ゆ\"},{\"title\":\"Sode no Shirayuki vs. Rukia! The Delusion of the Heart\",\"number\":232,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After hearing that Byakuya has gone missing, Rukia returns to the Seireitei to search for her brother and in the process comes across Sodenoshirayuki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"袖白雪vsルキア! 心の惑い\"},{\"title\":\"Zangetsu Becomes an Enemy\",\"number\":233,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Muramasa appears before Ichigo and explains how he freed the Zanpakuto from the Soul Reapers, as well as gave them a physical form to exist.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵となった斬月\"},{\"title\":\"Renji Surprised?! The Two Zabimaru\",\"number\":234,\"airDate\":\"2009-08-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Zanpakuto rebellion has left the Seireitei in a state of destruction with many Soul Reapers still missing, including Squad Six captain Byakuya Kuchiki.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恋次驚愕!? 2人の蛇尾丸\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! Hisagi vs. Kazeshini\",\"number\":235,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside Ichigo`s mind, Muramasa meets Hollow Ichigo. Taking an interest in him, Muramasa attempts to manifest Hollow Ichigo like he did with Zangetsu, only to discover that his spell does not work on Hollow Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! 檜佐木vs風死\"},{\"title\":\"Release! The New Getsuga Tenshou\",\"number\":236,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo has regained his Shikai and battles Muramasa. But Zangetsu, who has sided with Muramasa, steps in to fight Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"放て! 新たなる月牙天衝\"},{\"title\":\"Soi Fon, Surrounding the Zanpakutou\",\"number\":237,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo`s and Renji`s victories against their own Zanpakuto has proven that a Soul Reaper can reclaim his Zanpakuto by defeating it in battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"砕蜂, 斬魄刀を包囲せよ\"},{\"title\":\"Friendship? Hatred? Haineko & Tobiume\",\"number\":238,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Haineko and Tobiume, two Zanpakuto who do not get along, are walking through the woods when they spot Ichigo, who is in pursuit of Senbonzakura and Byakuya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"友情? 嫌悪? 灰猫 & 飛梅\"},{\"title\":\"The Awakening Hyourinmaru!\",\"number\":239,\"airDate\":\"2009-09-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle of Rangiku and Momo versus Haineko and Tobiume heats up, as both sides try to outsmart their opponents. Elsewhere, captain Toshiro Hitsugaya has located his Zanpakuto Hyorinmaru.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"目覚めよ氷輪丸!\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya`s Betrayal\",\"number\":240,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Results from Mayuri Kurotsuchi`s experiment using Marechiyo Omaeda`s Gegetsuburi show that a manifested Zanpakuto cannot revert to its original sword state when defeated by someone other than its master.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切りの白哉\"},{\"title\":\"For the Sake of Pride! Byakuya vs. Renji\",\"number\":241,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Thirteen Court Guard Squads, particularly Renji and Rukia, are shocked by the news of Byakuya now supposedly working with Muramasa. Meanwhile, inside Muramasa`s hideout, the Zanpakuto cannot hide their discomfort over having Byakuya join them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"誇りのために! 白哉VS恋次\"},{\"title\":\"Shinigami and Zanpakutou, Total Sortie\",\"number\":242,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"At the Squad Six Barracks, Renji and Rukia are determined to know why Byakuya has betrayed the Soul Society to work with Muramasa. Their conversation is cut short by the arrival of the manifested Zanpakuto.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神 & 斬魄刀, 総出撃\"},{\"title\":\"One-to-One Fight! Ichigo vs. Senbonzakura\",\"number\":243,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers find themselves in a tough battle against the manifested Zanpakuto, including Ichigo who is struggling against Senbonzakura.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一騎打ち! 一護VS千本桜\"},{\"title\":\"The Long Awaited... Kenpachi Appears!\",\"number\":244,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between Soul Reapers and Zanpakuto heats up as Kenpachi joins in the fight. Kenpachi easily overwhelms the Zanpakuto with his incredible Spirit Energy and then goes off to challenge Byakuya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"満を持して... 剣八登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Pursue Byakuya! The Confused Gotei Divisions\",\"number\":245,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, Renji, Rukia, and Izuru collapse after being exposed to Konjiki Ashisogijizo`s poison. Konjiki Ashisogijizo then seeks for its next prey but is stopped by Yachiru Kusajishi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉を追え! 混乱の護廷隊\"},{\"title\":\"Special Mission! Rescue Captain-Commander Yamamoto!\",\"number\":246,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yoruichi has located Muramasa`s hideout where Head Captain Yamamoto is being held. A team comprised of Ichigo, Shunsui, Jushiro, Kenpachi, and Yoruichi sets out to rescue the Head Captain, but the group soon encounters the Zanpakuto who were anticipating their arrival.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"特務! 山本総隊長を救出せよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Deceived Shinigami! The World Collapse Crisis\",\"number\":247,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo battles Muramasa in order to save Head Captain Yamamoto from captivity. Meanwhile, Yoruichi, Shunsui, and Jushiro notice that the Zanpakuto are trying to prevent them from reaching Ichigo, and quickly realize that he was the key to Muramasa`s plan all along.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"騙された死神! 世界崩壊の危機\"},{\"title\":\"Dragon of Ice and Dragon of Flame! The Strongest Showdown!\",\"number\":248,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Muramasa`s true objective is revealed to be in Karakura Town. Ichigo and the other Soul Reapers try to go after Muramasa, but the manifested Zanpakuto of Genryusai`s Ryujinjakka stands in their way.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"氷の龍と炎の龍! 最強対決!\"},{\"title\":\"Senbonzakura`s Bankai! Offense and Defense of the Living World\",\"number\":249,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu, Chad, and Orihime confront Muramasa who has entered the World of the Living. Using teamwork, Uryu and Chad at first appear to gain the upper hand in battle, when Senbonzakura appears to assist Muramasa.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"千本桜卍解! 現世の攻防\"},{\"title\":\"That Man, For the Sake of the Kuchiki\",\"number\":250,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Centuries ago, Ginrei Kuchiki, Byakuya Kuchiki`s grandfather, and his son-in-law Koga Kuchiki were assigned to bring down the rebel forces threatening the Seireitei. With his Zanpakuto Muramasa`s power, Koga wipes out the renegade Soul Reapers one after another, and soon his strength becomes known throughout the Soul Society. Yet Koga himself was frustrated by the fact that his father-in-law Ginrei did not seem to acknowledge his accomplishments.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"その男・朽木家ゆえに\"},{\"title\":\"Dark History! The Worst Shinigami is Born\",\"number\":251,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Koga Kuchiki escapes his confinement and in the process, kills the Soul Reapers who framed him. Although Ginrei sympathizes with his son-in-law`s situation, he reprimands Koga for his rash actions. Enraged, Koga severs his ties with the Kuchiki clan and begins killing Soul Reapers and innocent people.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"闇の歴史! 最凶の死神, 誕生\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya, the Truth Behind his Betrayal\",\"number\":252,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"To uphold the honor of his family, Byakuya Kuchiki fights the resurrected Koga Kuchiki. Meanwhile, the despair of being abandoned by Koga takes its toll on Muramasa`s body.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉, 裏切りに隠された真実\"},{\"title\":\"Muramasa`s True Identity Revealed\",\"number\":253,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Koga`s betrayal causes Muramasa to lose control over all of the Hollows he absorbed to sustain himself. To make matters worse, his immense Spiritual Pressure begins to attract other Hollows to Karakura Town. As Ichigo, Uryu, Chad, Orihime, and Rukia work together to deal with the situation, Muramasa fires a massive Cero towards them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"明かされた村正の正体\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya and Renji, the 6th Division Returns\",\"number\":254,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu and the others attempt to save Ichigo, who has been engulfed by Muramasa, but with little success. Meanwhile, the Soul Reapers of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads team up with their own Zanpakuto to fight the Hollows that have appeared in the World of the Living.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉と恋次, 六番隊再び\"},{\"title\":\"Final Chapter Zanpakuto Unknown Tales\",\"number\":255,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside Muramasa`s mind, Ichigo clashes blades with Muramasa. As Muramasa`s body and mind reach their limits, he begins to transform into a Hollow. With little time remaining, Ichigo and Muramasa decide to settle their score once and for all.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"終章・斬魄刀異聞篇\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya`s Anger! The Kuchiki Family Collapses\",\"number\":256,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the defeat of Muramasa, peace has returned to the Soul Society. Renji, Rukia, and the other Soul Reapers are having a good time at the Kuchiki mansion`s party, when the place is suddenly attacked by two unknown beings. Having left her Zanpakuto behind, Rukia falls into danger when, to her surprise, the manifested Sodenoshirayuki comes to her rescue.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"怒りの白哉! 朽木家崩壊\"},{\"title\":\"A New Enemy! The True Nature of the Beast Swords\",\"number\":257,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The assailants who attacked the Kuchiki mansion are identified as \\\"Sword Beasts,\\\" manifested Zanpakuto of Soul Reapers who lost their lives during the battle with Muramasa. Due to the potential danger, an order is issued throughout the Soul Society to hunt down all remaining Sword Beasts, including ones who have escaped into the World of the Living. Toshiro, Hyorinmaru, Rangiku, and Haineko go after a Sword Beast who is in the World of the Living searching for its master.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たな敵! 刀獣の正体\"},{\"title\":\"Stray Snake, Tortured Monkey\",\"number\":258,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Renji and Zabimaru (Monkey and Snake) come to the World of the Living to go after a Sword Beast. However, Snake is too distracted by his surroundings, and as a result lets the Sword Beast escape. After being scolded by Renji and Monkey, a frustrated Snake decides he wants to be his own man and runs off.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"迷子の蛇, 受難の猿\"},{\"title\":\"Terror! The Monster That Lurks Underground\",\"number\":259,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Isane and Hanataro are troubled by the recent reports of someone stealing food from the Squad Four barracks. Evidence shows that the thief is hiding in an underground waterway, and so a team comprised of Hanataro, Nanao, Ikkaku, and Hozukimaru is sent down for investigation.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恐怖! 地下に潜む怪物\"},{\"title\":\"Conclusion?! Hisagi vs. Kazeshini\",\"number\":260,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Following Muramasa`s defeat, most of the Zanpakuto have reconciled and returned to their masters, except for Kazeshini, who is still out to kill his former master Shuhei Hisagi. When Kazeshini goes into the Rukon District in the hopes of finding Shuhei, he instead comes across an infant who just lost his father to a Sword Beast. To Kazeshini`s annoyance, the infant has taken a liking to the rogue Zanpakuto and now refuses to leave his side.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"決着!? 檜佐木VS風死\"},{\"title\":\"The Person with the Unknown Ability! Orihime is Targeted\",\"number\":261,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Karakura Town has been experiencing a string of assaults, and the victims have all been reported to be high school girls carrying a pink bear charm. Meanwhile, a new girl transfers into Orihime`s class and introduces herself as Kyoko Haida. When Orihime accidentally exposes her powers before Kyoko, the new girl takes an interest in her, claiming she is worthy to become her friend.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"未知なる能力者! 狙われた織姫\"},{\"title\":\"The Tragic Sword Fiend! Haineko Cries!\",\"number\":262,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"During a mission to hunt down the Sword Beasts, Haineko comes across a wounded Sword Beast called Narunosuke and, to her surprise, falls in love with the handsome enemy before her. Believing that Narunosuke is different from other Sword Beasts, Haineko goes against her orders and decides to look after him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悲劇の刀獣! 灰猫, 号泣!\"},{\"title\":\"Confinement!? Senbonzakura and Zabimaru\",\"number\":263,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Renji`s Zanpakuto Zabimaru, consisting of Monkey and Snake, are irritated over the fact that Byakuya`s Senbonzakura is taking all the credit for their work. Later, a small accident leads to the three Zanpakuto becoming trapped inside the Department of Research and Development`s facility. As they try to find a means to escape, the two Zabimarus find Senbonzakura to be more troublesome than either of them had anticipated.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"幽閉!? 千本桜&蛇尾丸\"},{\"title\":\"Women`s Fight? Katenkyoukotsu vs Nanao!\",\"number\":264,\"airDate\":\"2010-03-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Lieutenant Nanao Ise is paired up with Katenkyokotsu Wakizashi, the shorter of Captain Kyoraku`s two swords, to hunt for Sword Beasts. But Nanao finds Wakizashi`s malicious and distrustful nature to be quite difficult to work with.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"女の戦い? 花天狂骨VS七緒!\"},{\"title\":\"Progress!? The Last Sword Fiend Threat!\",\"number\":265,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Zanpakuto notice the remaining Sword Beasts acting strangely and realize it to be the work of Kirikaze, a Sword Beast capable of robbing Spirit Energy from others. With their time to manifest as physical entities reaching its limits, the Zanpakuto are determined to carry out their last mission to defeat Kirikaze.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"進化!? 最後の刀獣の脅威!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Vs Ulquiorra, Restart!\",\"number\":266,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aizen leads Tosen, Gin, and the Espadas as they invade the World of the Living. Aizen’s real objective is to annihilate Karakura Town to create Ouken, the royal key and take the Soul Society by storm. The Soul Reapers anticipate this and prepare for battle. Meanwhile, Ichigo gets on his way to save Orihime from the Fifth Tower where she is being held captive. And then, Ichigo and Ulquiorra’s fated showdown finally begins!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護VSウルキオラ, 再開!\"},{\"title\":\"Connected Hearts! The Left Fist Prepared for Death!\",\"number\":267,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Below the Fifth Tower, Sado and Renji battle it out with a giant Hollow. But then, the sandman Batticaloa arrives to the scene. Batticaloa’s body is made of sand, so Sado and Renji have a hard time inflicting any damage on him. And Rukia, whose ice-snow Zanpakuto is the sole weapon that can contend with Batticaloa, is struggling in another battle against Rudobon. Meanwhile, Ichigo and Ulquiorra are still battling when Ichigo learns that Orihime has already been converted to Ulquiorra’s side. Ichigo pretends it doesn’t concern him, but he can’t hide his distress.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"繋がる心! 決死の左拳!\"},{\"title\":\"Jealousy and Hatred... Orihime`s Dilemma\",\"number\":268,\"airDate\":\"2010-04-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Orihime is watching Ichigo and Ulquiorra’s battle from the sidelines, Loly and Menoly appear before her. They learned that Orihime is no longer of any use to Aizen, and they want to seize this opportunity to defeat her. Orihime has no means to fight back, and she gets hurt left and right. When Ichigo notices this, he tries to go rescue her, but Ulquiorra keeps getting in his way, and he is unable to get anywhere near Orihime. Amidst the chaos, a new enemy breaks through the floor of the Fifth Tower and appears before Ichigo and the others. The new enemy is none other than Yammy who came to assist Ulquiorra.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"嫉妬と憎悪... 窮地の織姫!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo and Uryuu, Back to Back Bonds!\",\"number\":269,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu rushes to stop Yammy from attacking Orihime. Ichigo is surprised, but Uryu charges at Yammy without hesitation. Uryu notices that Ichigo, concerned about Orihime, was not using the power of his Hollowfication, and Uryu was trying to get the fight with Yammy over with as quickly as possible. However, Yammy’s body is tough, and every attack from Ginreikojaku’s arrow and Seeleschneider is repelled. Yammy triumphantly brings out a giant Cero on them. Just when they thought it couldn’t get any worse…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護と雨竜(うりゅう), 背中合わせの絆!\"},{\"title\":\"Beginning of Despair... Ichigo, the Unreachable Blade\",\"number\":270,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ulquiorra’s sword release, Murcielago, is too strong for Ichigo and every swift attack further injures him. Even when he fires Getsugatensho with all of his remaining power, Ichigo is unable to wound Ulquiorra. In spite of that, Ichigo continues to attack Ulquiorra in order to save Orihime and go back with his friends. But Ulquiorra tries to show off his Resurreccion Segunda Etapa.  Meanwhile, Orihime and Uryu are worried about Ichigo as they head to the top of the dome…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶望の始まり... 一護, 届かぬ刃\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Dies! Orihime, the Cry of Sorrow!\",\"number\":271,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Orihime and Uryu make it to the top of the dome, they see Ichigo collapsed in front of Ulquiorra. Orihime’s reaction is to rush over to Ichigo, but Ulquiorra tells her that it’s no use. Just then, Uryu hits Ulquiorra with his arrow. But like all of Ichigo’s attacks, Uryu’s arrow is ineffective against Ulquiorra. Ulquiorra attacks back and Uryu is no longer able to even draw his bow. Distressed by the situation, Orihime calls out to the immobile Ichigo for help. Then something happens to Ichigo’s body….\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護死す! 織姫, 悲痛の叫び!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Vs Ulquiorra, Conclusion!\",\"number\":272,\"airDate\":\"2010-05-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia, Renji, and Sado are battling Rudobon and the soldiers he created. But then, another enemy appears before them. It is Yammy, who fell off of the Fifth Tower. The three of them are surprised that Yammy has transformed into a giant. In the meantime, on top of the dome, a Hollowfied Ichigo is fighting Ulquiorra. When Uryu tries to stop Ichigo…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護vsウルキオラ, 決着!\"},{\"title\":\"Fury of a Shark! Halibel Releases\",\"number\":273,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rukia, Renji, and Sado struggle against the giant Yammy. However, when they see Yammy’s tattoo of the number “10”, they realize that he is weaker than the Espadas they’ve fought in the past. Each one of them tries to go after Yammy, but Yammy releases  his sword, Ira , which overwhelms them. Meanwhile, in Karakura Town, the battle between the Soul Reapers and the Espada, led by Aizen, intensifies. Halibel attacks Hitsugaya, who achieves Bankai and counterattacks, but…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"鮫の猛威! ハリベル解放\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya, the Suicidal Frozen Heavens Hundred Flowers Funeral!\",\"number\":274,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hitsugaya is doing everything he can to counter Halibel’s sword release, Tiburon. Halibel says she will win against Hitsugaya to avenge her Fracciónes. She melts the ice with Hirviendo and drives Hitsugaya into a corner. Hitsugaya counters by turning Halibel’s water attack into ice with his Zanpakuto, Hyorinmaru, but Halibel has other tricks up her sleeve…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷, 捨て身の氷天百華葬[ひょうてんひゃっかそう]!\"},{\"title\":\"The Approaching Breath of Death... the King Who Rules Over Death!\",\"number\":275,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Hitsugaya and Halibel’s battle looks to be coming to a close, Omaeda and Soi Fon fight against Barragan. Just when Soi Fon is about to attack Barragan, Soi Fon suddenly becomes sluggish. Soi Fon is baffled, and Barragan tells her that he has the power to age people. Barragan only has to will old age upon his opponent and touch that person for the opponent to immediately grow old and die. Soi Fon now understands the severity of this power, but she has already been touched by Barragan…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"迫る死の息吹... 死を司る王!\"},{\"title\":\"One Hit Kill! Soi Fon, Bankai!\",\"number\":276,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between the Soul Reapers and the Espada becomes more and more tense. Soi Fon and Omaeda find themselves in a bad situation against Barragan’s Respira. They can’t even counterattack Respira because they can’t get anywhere near it. Then, Soi Fon goes off somewhere, leaving Omaeda to fight Barragan alone. Omaeda attacks with Gegetsuburi, but Barragan destroys it easily with Respira. Just when Omaeda is backed into a corner, Soi Fon arrives, having released her Bankai…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一撃決殺! 砕蜂, 卍解!\"},{\"title\":\"Climax! Kyouraku Vs Starrk!\",\"number\":277,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kyoraku and Stark are both fighting defensively in their battle. But Stark’s expression changes when he spots Hitsugaya and Soi Fon’s Bankai. Kyoraku leaves his haori with Ukitake to confront Stark. Stark calls Lilinette over, and tells everyone that the two of them used to be one person. Stark then releases his Resurrección and takes on the form of Los Lobos. Kyoraku achieves Shikai and they continue to fight for real!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白熱! 京楽vsスターク!\"},{\"title\":\"The Nightmare Returns... Revival of the Espada\",\"number\":278,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kyoraku is in a pinch, and Ukitake, who had been watching the battle, steps in. Ukitake fires Cero at Stark, even though it is a technique that Soul Reapers shouldn’t be able to use. Stark is surprised, but he quickly recovers from the shock and shoots something back at him. Then, all of a sudden, Garganta starts to open to reveal the creepy Wonderweiss and Fura. All of the Soul Reapers are exhausted from battling, and they are in no state to face a new opponent…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"悪夢再び... 復活の十刃\"},{\"title\":\"Hirako and Aizen... the Reunion of Fate!\",\"number\":279,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers find themselves in hot water against Fura and Wonderweiss when the Visoreds, led by Shinji Hirako, make their appearance. Used in Aizen’s Hollowfication experiment 101 years ago, the Visoreds have since lived in hiding in the World of the Living. Believing that now is the time to defeat Aizen, the Visoreds have set foot on the battlefield.  Recognizing familiar faces, both Visoreds and Soul Reapers exchange words with one another. Wonderweiss disrupts the scene by signaling Fura to release hordes of Menos…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"平子と藍染... 因縁の再会!\"},{\"title\":\"Hisagi and Tousen, the Moment of Parting\",\"number\":280,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hisagi joins Komamura to battle Tosen in hopes of bringing his former captain back to his senses. Meanwhile the other Soul Reapers form an uneasy alliance with the Visoreds: Lisa, Hiyori, and Hitsugaya take on Halibel. Love and Rose take on Stark. Hachi, Omaeda, and Soi Fon take on Barragan. The battle against the Espada resumes!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"檜佐木と東仙... 訣別の時!\"},{\"title\":\"Crown of Lies, Baragan`s Grudge\",\"number\":281,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Barragan appears to be defeated by the combined efforts of Hachigen and Soi Fon. But the two are shocked to find Barragan forcing open Hachigen’s Shiju Saimon barrier. As king of Hueco Mundo, Barragan is determined to show the world his absolute strength and power. His reason originates as far back to when he once reigned over his subjects in Las Noches. Having no enemies to conquer, Barragan would pit his subjects against one another to fight off his boredom. That was when Aizen arrived in Hueco Mundo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"偽りの王冠, バラガンの怨恨\"},{\"title\":\"Power of the Soul! The Wolves, Attack!\",\"number\":282,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Stark shows no sign of getting serious in his battle against Love and Rose. Running out of patience, Lilinette begins to mindlessly fire at the two Visoreds without Stark’s permission. But her attacks prove to be ineffective against the two, and she is gradually cornered by the pair’s fine team play. Finally, Love hits Stark with his Zanpakuto attack, and the Espada is thrown into a sea of flames.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魂の力! 群狼, 襲来!\"},{\"title\":\"Starrk, the Lone Battle\",\"number\":283,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Stark splits his own soul and shapes it into packs of wolves and launches them against Love and Rose. Preparing to deliver the finishing blow, Stark is caught off guard by Shunsui, who suddenly appears out of Stark’s shadow. Despite his best efforts to dodge the attacks, Stark is gradually weakened. Just then the wolves, headed by Lilinette, swarm over Shunsui. He brushes them off, and the wolves disappear. Stark calls out for Lilinette but hears no reply.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"スターク, たった独りの戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Chain of Sacrifice, Harribel`s Past\",\"number\":284,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Las Noches. Long ago, Apache, at the time still an Adjucha-class Hollow, was hunted by other Hollows when Halibel saved her life. Apache soon joins Halibel’s group consisting of Sun-Sun and Mila Rose. As they spend more time together, Apache notices Halibel does not devour the enemies she defeats. When questioned, Halibel responds that she does not wish to become stronger by sacrificing others.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"犠牲の連鎖, ハリベルの過去\"},{\"title\":\"The Hundred-Year Grudge! Hiyori`s Revenge\",\"number\":285,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With the Espada gone, the Visoreds are now able to confront Aizen. Having been unwilling test subjects in Aizen’s past experiment, the Visoreds make no effort to hide their hatred toward the man who destroyed their lives. Hiyori, unable hold in her anger, is the first to attack Aizen with her blade. Meanwhile, Chad, Renji, and Rukia continue their fight against Yammy in Hueco Mundo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"百年の怨恨! ひよ里の復讐\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo`s Return! Protect Karakura Town\",\"number\":286,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo goes up against Yammy. Rukia notices that Ichigo is acting strange following his battle with Ulquiorra and shows her concern for him. Ichigo is also shaken up by the fact that his Hollowfication now feels different. But, unable to forgive Yammy for labeling Ulquiorra and Grimmjow as trash, Ichigo makes another attempt at his Hollowfication.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護の帰還! 空座町を護れ\"},{\"title\":\"Side Story! Ichigo and the Magic Lamp\",\"number\":287,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo wakes up to find himself in the middle of a desert. Sitting next to a confused Ichigo are Uryu, Orihime, and Chad, all dressed in an Arabian style. Introducing themselves as “Urio,” “Ori Mei,” and “Chaido,” the three explain that they are in search of a treasure called the “Snow Crystal.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"外伝! 一護と魔法のランプ\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Trump Card! Ichigo, Towards the Decisive Battle\",\"number\":288,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kenpachi overcomes Yammy’s monstrous size and tough exterior to land a clean blow against the Espada. Meanwhile, Ichigo uses Garganta to return to the World of the Living. On the way, Captain Unohana explains to Ichigo about Aizen’s power of “Complete Hypnosis.” She then reveals that Ichigo is the key to defeating Aizen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の切り札! 一護, 決戦へ\"},{\"title\":\"Byakuya vs. Kenpachi?! The Melee Commences\",\"number\":289,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As he holds a dying Hiyori, an enraged Hirako readies himself to confront Aizen in battle. Meanwhile, Hisagi and Komamura battle Tosen in a desperate attempt to bring their former ally back to his senses. But Tosen, who believes he follows a just path, ignores their plea and attacks them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"白哉VS剣八?! 乱戦開始\"},{\"title\":\"For the Sake of Justice?! The Man Who Deserted the Shinigami\",\"number\":290,\"airDate\":\"2010-09-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Komamura performs his Bankai, Kokujo Tengen Myo-oh, to subdue Tosen. However, Tosen has already deduced the weakness of Komamura’s Bankai from years of working closely together. Despite the damage received, Komamura refuses to give up on his former friend, throwing out the question of why Tosen chose to become a Soul Reaper in the first place.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"正義の為に?! 死神を捨てた男\"},{\"title\":\"Desperate Struggle with Aizen! Hirako, Shikai!\",\"number\":291,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tosen is now able to see in his Ressureccion form. But Komamura states that in exchange for his vision, Tosen has now blinded his own heart. Unable to bring himself to kill the man he wanted to save, Komamura falls before Tosen’s attack. Meanwhile, Hirako prepares to use his Shikai, Sakanade, against Aizen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"藍染との死闘! 平子, 始解!\"},{\"title\":\"All Out War! Aizen vs. Shinigami!\",\"number\":292,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo has returned to the World of the Living to battle Aizen. After an unsuccessful first attack, Ichigo Hollowfies to deliver his Getsugatensho against Aizen, but that too proves ineffective. Witnessing the immense power Aizen holds, Ichigo begins to lose his will to fight, when the Thirteen Court Guard Squads stand up to support him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全面戦争! 藍染VS死神!\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya, Enraged! Blade of Hatred!\",\"number\":293,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Thirteen Court Guard Squads and Visoreds launch a full-scale attack against Aizen. But Aizen makes quick work of their combined efforts. Just when all hope is thought to be lost, Hirako uses his Zanpakuto’s power to draw away Aizen’s attention, giving way for Hitsugaya to deliver the killing blow.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷, 激昂! 憎しみの刃!\"},{\"title\":\"The Sealed Genryuusai!\",\"number\":294,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Head Captain Genryusai Yamamoto of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads steps in to battle Aizen. Genryusai’s attempt to incinerate Aizen in a blazing inferno is thwarted by Wonderweiss, whose Ressureccion form extinguishes the flames. Wonderweiss is revealed to be a Mod Arrancar created by Aizen for the sole purpose of sealing away Genryusai’s zanpakuto, Ryujinjakka.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"封印された元柳斎!\"},{\"title\":\"It`s All a Trap... Engineered Bonds!\",\"number\":295,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo succeeds in wounding Aizen with his Hollowfied Getsugatensho attack. But to his surprise, the Hogyoku instantly heals Aizen’s wound. Aizen then reveals an even more shocking truth to Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"全ては罠... 仕組まれた絆!\"},{\"title\":\"The Shocking Truth...The Mysterious Power Within Ichigo!\",\"number\":296,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aizen’s revelation that Ichigo is his greatest research subject throws Ichigo into a state of shock. But before Aizen can reveal Ichigo’s most startling secret he is interrupted by an unexpected person arriving on the scene.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"衝撃の真実... 一護に秘められた力!\"},{\"title\":\"The Extending Blade?! Ichigo vs. Gin!\",\"number\":297,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"As they cross blades, Gin asks Ichigo if he recalls their last encounter, to which Ichigo responds he does not remember Gin’s “heart” being present back then. Ichigo’s answer prompts Gin to display his Bankai and its incredible power. Meanwhile, Isshin notices a change occurring within Aizen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"伸びる刃!? 一護VSギン!\"},{\"title\":\"Film! Festival! Shinigami Film Festival!\",\"number\":298,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A Seireitei International Film Festival is to be held in the Soul Society, and Nanao recruits Ichigo and his friends to cooperate with the filming. The crew consists of Rukia in the lead role, Renji as the director, Uryu as the costume designer, with Rangiku, Orihime, and Chad as supporting cast members. Will these guys really be able complete the film and win the award for best film?!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"映画だ! 祭りだ! 死神映画祭!\"},{\"title\":\"Theatre Opening Commemoration! Hell Chapter: Prologue\",\"number\":299,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While visiting the World of the Living, Rukia comes across Kurumadani, the current Soul Reaper stationed in Karakura Town, being attacked by a mysterious masked man. To her surprise, the masked man reveals himself as Shrieker, the Hollow previously defeated and sent to hell by Rukia and Chad.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"劇場公開記念! 地獄編・序章\"},{\"title\":\"Urahara Appears! Stop Aizen!\",\"number\":300,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kisuke Urahara steps onto the battlefield as Aizen, fused with the Hogyoku, begins his transformation. Urahara’s Kido attack appears ineffective against Aizen, who claims he has complete control over the Hogyoku. But Urahara’s true goal was to turn Aizen’s own spirit energy against himself.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"浦原登場! 藍染を阻止せよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo Loses His Fighting Spirit!? Gin`s Expectation!\",\"number\":301,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo finds himself cornered against Gin’s Bankai. But to Ichigo’s surprise, Gin advises him to run from this battle. Meanwhile, Urahara, Yoruichi, and Isshin fight Aizen in a three-on-one battle. But none of their attacks appear to work against Aizen.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護, 戦意喪失!? ギンの思惑!\"},{\"title\":\"The Final Getsuga Tenshou!? Ichigo`s Training!\",\"number\":302,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While going after Aizen, who has left for Karakura Town, Ichigo and Isshin arrive in the Precipice World, a place where time flows two thousand times slower than the outside world. Isshin decides to use this opportunity to have Ichigo acquire the “Final Getsugatensho,” which could defeat Aizen. Meanwhile, at the Karakura Town relocated to the Soul Society, Keigo and Tatsuki wake up to realize something terrible is happening to their town.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最後の月牙天衝!? 一護の修行!\"},{\"title\":\"Real World and Shinigami! The New Year Special!\",\"number\":303,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Women’s Soul Reaper Association is hosting a New Year’s party in the Soul Society, when Hitsugaya and the other male Soul Reapers come crashing in. Meanwhile in the World of the Living, everyone is spending New Year’s with their families. Orihime, who has no family, spends her time alone, when Rukia and Renji come by to say their New Year’s greeting.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"現世も死神も! お正月スペシャル!\"},{\"title\":\"Another Side Story! This Time the Enemy Is a Monster!?\",\"number\":304,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Two monster hunters arrive at an old castle where Franken Ichigo, Succubus Rukia, Vampire Uryu, Pumpkin Orihime, Mummy Renji, Witch Rangiku, and Wolfman Hitsugaya all live as lackluster monsters.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"外伝再び! 今度の敵はモンスター!?\"},{\"title\":\"Delusion Roars! Hisagi, Towards the Hot Springs Inn!\",\"number\":305,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Shuhei Hisagi leads a busy life handling the duties of Squad 9 Lieutenant and Editor in Chief of the Seireitei Bulletin, as well as preparing picnic lunches for the Soul Reapers. One day, Hisagi and Rangiku are sent to investigate a string of disappearances in the Rukon district. But being alone together with Rangiku causes Hisagi’s imagination to go wild, which worsens when Rangiku suggests spending the night at an inn.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"妄想爆走! 檜佐木(ひさぎ), 温泉旅館へ!\"},{\"title\":\"For the Sake of Protecting! Ichigo Vs. Tensa Zangetsu!\",\"number\":306,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aizen and Gin close in on Tatsuki, when Don Kanonji comes to the rescue. A still-injured Rangiku also arrives to confront Gin. Meanwhile, seeking to learn the Final Getsugatensho, Ichigo battles Tensa Zangetsu and Hollow Ichigo, who have now merged into one being.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"護(まも)るために! 一護vs天鎖斬月!\"},{\"title\":\"Emergency Situation! Aizen, New Evolution!\",\"number\":307,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Aizen continues his pursuit of Ichigo’s friends. Fearing for their lives, Keigo attempts to attack Aizen using the Zanpakuto he stole from Kurumadani. Gin returns to Aizen after having personally dealt with Rangiku, and his appearance prompts Tatsuki and the others to prepare for the worst.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"緊急事態! 藍染, 更なる進化!\"},{\"title\":\"Goodbye... Rangiku\",\"number\":308,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Gin recalls his past and the fateful event that led him to become a Soul Reaper serving under Aizen. Meanwhile, Aizen’s overwhelming Spiritual Pressure forces Tatsuki, Keigo and the others to fall helplessly to the ground, when Ichigo finally arrives after completing his training.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"さよなら... 乱菊\"},{\"title\":\"Fierce Fighting Conclusion! Release, the Final Getsuga Tensho!\",\"number\":309,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Battle ensues between Aizen and Ichigo. His nineties-level Kido attack easily deflected, Aizen further evolves to best Ichigo. But Ichigo, now fully aware of why Tensa Zangetsu was reluctant to teach him the Final Getsugatensho, has come to possess amazing powers.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激闘決着! 放て, 最後の月牙天衝!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo`s Resolution! The Price of the Fierce Battle\",\"number\":310,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle in Karakura Town and the Soul Society has come to an end. Karakura Town is returned to the World of the Living using Mayuri’s technology, and everyone prepares to return to their respective places. Ichigo is reunited with his friends who have returned from Hueco Mundo, when his condition suddenly changes.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護の覚悟! 激闘の代償\"},{\"title\":\"The Soul Detective - Karakuraizer Takes Off Again!\",\"number\":311,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Karakurizer is back! As Karakurizer, Kon tries to impress the ladies when a man named Michel appears. Strong, kind, handsome, and a true hero, Michel instantly gains popularity from the townspeople and the other Karakurizer. Can Karakurizer reclaim the title of No. 1 hero?! Go, Karakurizer!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"魂葬刑事・カラクライザー再発進!\"},{\"title\":\"Inauguration! The Brand New 2nd Division Captain!\",\"number\":312,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While slacking off on his duties, Omaeda falls from a cliff. Recovering from the fall, Omaeda finds a young boy named Ryuzaburo staring at him with admiration and learns that he has unintentionally saved the boy’s life from a Hollow. When asked for his name, Omaeda lies and says he is the captain of Squad 2.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"就任! 新たなる二番隊隊長!\"},{\"title\":\"The Man Who Takes Command of the 11th Division!\",\"number\":313,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While sparring with Ikkaku and Renji inside Squad 11’s dojo, Ichigo meets Seizo, whose mild-mannered personality seems out of place within the hot-blooded Squad 11. Once a powerful Soul Reaper, Seizo lost most of his spirit energy after taking a hit from a Hollow meant for Ikkaku. Ichigo, having seen Seizo’s unfair treatment within the squad, questions if he is truly content with his current life.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"十一番隊に命を懸けた男!\"},{\"title\":\"Secret of a Beautiful Office Lady\",\"number\":314,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Ichigo is looking into a possible Hollow incident in the World of the Living, Kon, inside Ichigo’s body, meets a beautiful woman who can see spirits. But the woman was dumped by her boyfriend because of this power and now wishes to die. Kon tries to stop the woman from killing herself when a handsome Hollow appears!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"美人OLの秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Yachiru`s Friend! The Shinigami of Justice Appears!\",\"number\":315,\"airDate\":\"2011-03-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Yachiru encounters a Soul Reaper saving a girl from a Hollow, and quickly recognizes him as Masayoshi, her old friend. As the two celebrate their reunion, Yachiru learns that “Mappy” has lost his wife to a Hollow. Since then, Masayoshi has sworn to kill all Hollows for the people of the Rukon District, and for his late wife. But something about Masayoshi’s story does not sit well with Yachiru.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"やちるの友! 正義の死神登場!\"},{\"title\":\"Hitsugaya Toushirou`s Day Off!\",\"number\":316,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Hitsugaya has taken some time off and comes to Karakura Town to visit Haru, an old lady he met during a previous visit to the World of the Living. Grandma Haru introduces Hitsugaya and Karin to Yosuke, a young spirit who died before being able to experience his first snow. Hitsugaya decides to wait on performing Konso on Yosuke until the boy gets his wish, when Haru’s health suddenly worsens…\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"日番谷冬獅郎(ひつがやとうしろう)の休日!\"},{\"title\":\"Unusual Incident in Seireitei?! Gotei 13 Invading Army Arc!\",\"number\":317,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Peace has seemingly returned to both the World of the Living and the Soul Society with Aizen’s defeat. But reports of Soul Reapers going missing after entering the Precipice World begin to surface in the Soul Society. Meanwhile in the World of the Living, Kon finds an unconscious girl lying in the street and brings her home to care for, while Ichigo and Rukia discover that they are unable to contact the Soul Society.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"瀞霊廷(せいれいてい)に異変! 護廷(ごてい)十三隊侵軍篇!\"},{\"title\":\"Renji vs. Rukia?! Battle With Comrades!\",\"number\":318,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo is placed under arrest by the Soul Society under suspicion of being responsible for the disappearance of the Soul Reapers in the Precipice World. With Rukia’s help, the two make an escape, when Renji and Ikkaku appear to do battle.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"恋次(れんじ)vsルキア!? 仲間との戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo`s Capture Net! Escape From Soul Society!\",\"number\":319,\"airDate\":\"2011-04-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Rukia find stored records on Nozomi at the Department of Research and Development, and realize the World of the Living is in danger. Hurrying to get back, the two regroup with Yoruichi, who proposes to get past the heavily guarded Senkaimon by force. Meanwhile in the World of the Living, Kon and Nozomi find themselves attacked by Kira, Nanao, and a Soul Reaper calling himself Kageroza.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護捕縛網! 尸魂界を脱出せよ!\"},{\"title\":\"Gotei 13, Gathering in the Real World!\",\"number\":320,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Thirteen Court Guard Squads who attacked Ichigo and Rukia in the Soul Society are revealed to be imposters known as Reigai, who have switched places with their originals. Thanks to the work of Mayuri, the real captains and lieutenants are rescued from the Precipice World, and they all regroup in the World of the Living to discuss how to deal with this new crisis. Meanwhile, to help Nozomi feel welcomed, Ichigo and the others decide to host a barbecue party, when Nozomi suddenly runs off.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"護廷十三隊, 現世に集結!\"},{\"title\":\"Ikkaku vs. Ikkaku! Showdown of Mutual Self!\",\"number\":321,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kon goes out to search for Nozomi and finds her wandering aimlessly. Meanwhile, the Soul Society has assembled a special team, including the Reigai of Ikkaku, Yumichika, and Hisagi, to apprehend Ichigo. The Reigai arrive in the World of the Living where they encounter their originals, and a battle ensues!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一角(いっかく)vs一角! 自分同士の戦い!\"},{\"title\":\"Clash! Rukia vs. Rukia!\",\"number\":322,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Rangiku faces the Reigai of Izuru, but the imposter’s Zanpakuto proves to be more powerful then she anticipated. Rukia is also having a tough battle against the Reigai of herself and Nemu, when help arrives from an unexpected person. Meanwhile in the Soul Society, Ukitake pleads for Kyoraku’s release to Central 46.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突! ルキアVSルキア!\"},{\"title\":\"Protect Ichigo! Nozomi`s Determination!\",\"number\":323,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Chad encounters Renji’s Reigai while searching for Nozomi, and a battle ensues between the two. Meanwhile, Unohana grows suspicious over the events surrounding Kyoraku’s arrest, and begins to conduct her own research. In the process, Unohana learns that Kageroza is the mastermind behind this incident.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"護れ一護! 望実の決意!\"},{\"title\":\"Recapture Seireitei!\",\"number\":324,\"airDate\":\"2011-05-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The captains of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads take action to reclaim the Soul Society back from the Reigai.  As they successfully reenter the Soul Society, Kenpachi encounters his Reigai, and a fierce battle ensues. Meanwhile, Genryusai battles the Reigai of Kyoraku and Ukitake but notices something odd about their movements.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"瀞霊廷(せいれいてい)奪還へ! 隊長たち, 動く!\"},{\"title\":\"For the Sake of the Believers! Byakuya vs. Hitsugaya!\",\"number\":325,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Moved by Ichigo and his friends’ efforts to protect her, Nozomi decides to stay with the group and begins to use her powers to heal Ichigo. Meanwhile in the Soul Society, Byakuya faces the Reigai of Hitsugaya.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"信ずるものの為に! 白哉(びゃくや)vs日番谷(ひつがや)!\"},{\"title\":\"The Two Hinamori, Hitsugaya`s Resolution\",\"number\":326,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo leaves for the Soul Society to join the battle, only to be ambushed by Kageroza, who intends to erase Ichigo’s existence. Back in the Soul Society, the wounded captains find themselves facing new Reigai to battle, while Hitsugaya is reunited with Hinamori.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ふたりの雛森, 日番谷の覚悟\"},{\"title\":\"Pride of the Kuchiki Family! Byakuya Vs. Byakuya!\",\"number\":327,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captains of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads continue their battle to reclaim the Soul Society. Head Captain Yamamoto takes on the Reigai of Kyoraku and Ukitake, but is gradually overwhelmed by the two. Meanwhile in the World of the Living, Nozomi and the others learn of Ichigo’s disappearance inside the Precipice World.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"朽木家の誇り! 白哉VS白哉!\"},{\"title\":\"Defeat Kageroza! Shinigami, All-Out War!\",\"number\":328,\"airDate\":\"2011-06-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Captains Hitsugaya and Kenpachi have located Kageroza and proceed to attack him, but Kageroza retaliates by controlling the Precipice World to his advantage. Back in the World of the Living, Nozomi and the others continue their search for the missing Ichigo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"影狼佐を倒せ! 死神, 総力戦!\"},{\"title\":\"The Forbidden Research... Nozomi`s Hidden Secret!\",\"number\":329,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, who was swept away by the Cleaner inside the Precipice World, has safely returned to the World of the Living to everyone’s delight. Meanwhile in the Soul Society, the Reigai are revealed to be Mod Souls created by Kageroza.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"禁断の研究... 望実に隠された秘密!\"},{\"title\":\"I Want to Live...! Nozomi`s Zanpakutou\",\"number\":330,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers in the World of the Living have lost contact with the captains in the Soul Society. Meanwhile, the revelation of Nozomi being a Mod Soul surprises Ichigo and his friends. Kon is particularly shocked, and is now unsure of how to interact with Nozomi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"生きたい...! 望実の斬魄刀\"},{\"title\":\"For the Sake of Fighting! The Awakened Nozomi!\",\"number\":331,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nozomi wishes to join the battle against the Reigai, believing her Zanpakuto may stand a chance against Kageroza’s Zanpakuto. But the Soul Reapers are unable to completely trust Nozomi due to her power not being fully awakened yet. Ichigo and his friends decide to help Nozomi by training her to reach Shikai.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"戦うために! 目覚めよ望実!\"},{\"title\":\"The Most Evil Reigai, Appearing in the Real World!\",\"number\":332,\"airDate\":\"2011-07-26\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Having regained her Shikai, Nozomi tries to join Ichigo and the others to fight the Reigai captains, but the other Soul Reapers tell her not to interfere. In the midst of the battle, Hisagi and Izuru are brought down by the Reigai of Hitsugaya, who prepares to finish off the two lieutenants.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"最凶の霊骸(れいがい), 現世に現る!\"},{\"title\":\"Destroy Nozomi!? Genryuusai`s Decision!\",\"number\":333,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-02\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Head Captain Genryusai Yamamoto steps in to battle against the Reigai. Ichigo and Nozomi join Genryusai, each taking on the Reigai of captains Unohana, Ukitake, and Kyoraku.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"望実を消す!? 元柳斎(げんりゅうさい)の決断!\"},{\"title\":\"The Depleting Reiatsu! Ichigo, Death Struggle of the Soul!\",\"number\":334,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-09\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Nozomi’s Zanpakuto breaks in the midst of trying to protect Genryusai from Kageroza’s attack. As Ichigo and Kon try to save Nozomi from being taken away, Kageroza reveals a shocking secret between him and Nozomi.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"失われる霊圧! 一護, 魂の死闘!\"},{\"title\":\"Hiding in the Dangai? Ichigo is Alone?!\",\"number\":335,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-16\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Following his defeat by Kageroza, Ichigo has lost his Soul Reaper powers. Still determined to save Nozomi, Ichigo and his friends gather at Urahara’s shop to come up with a rescue plan.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"断界(だんがい)に潜伏? もう一人の一護(いちご)!?\"},{\"title\":\"Pursue Kageroza! Technological Development Department, Infiltration!\",\"number\":336,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-23\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside the Precipice World, Rukia and the others act as decoys to draw away the Reigai’s attention while Ichigo, Urahara, and Kon break into the Seireitei. As they search for Kageroza’s laboratory, Urahara makes an attempt to restore Ichigo’s lost Soul Reaper powers but is discovered by the Reigai of Nemu and Nanao.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"影狼佐(かげろうざ)を追え! 技術開発局, 潜入!\"},{\"title\":\"The Developer of the Modified Souls\",\"number\":337,\"airDate\":\"2011-08-30\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The captains and lieutenants of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads thought to have fallen in battle return to fight the Reigai. Meanwhile, Ichigo’s spirit energy and Hollow powers continue to grow unstable, forcing him to rest for the time being.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"改造魂魄(こんぱく)の開発者\"},{\"title\":\"Kon`s Thoughts, Nozomi`s Thoughts\",\"number\":338,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Inside the Maggot’s Nest, Urahara and Kon find Ouko Yushima, the man behind Kageroza’s invasion. Finding traces of Kageroza’s blood nearby, the two follow the trail and finally discover Nozomi’s whereabouts.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"コンの想い, 望実の想い\"},{\"title\":\"Protect Ichigo! The Bonds of Friends!\",\"number\":339,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Kageroza, having regained his complete powers, sets out to kill the Hollowfied Ichigo when Rukia, Uryu, Renji, Chad, and Orihime arrive to stop him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護を護れ! 仲間たちの絆!\"},{\"title\":\"Reigai Vs. Original, The Fierce Fighting for Gambled Pride!\",\"number\":340,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The captains of the Thirteen Court Guard Squads find themselves gradually overpowered by the Reigai forces. Meanwhile, Rukia, Uryu, Renji and Chad use their teamwork to fight Kageroza.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"霊骸vs原種, 誇りを賭けた激闘!\"},{\"title\":\"Invading Army Arc, Final Conclusion!\",\"number\":341,\"airDate\":\"2011-09-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"An unexpected change comes over the Reigai as the Soul Reapers continue to fight them. Meanwhile, Ichigo and Kageroza have their final showdown.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"侵軍篇, 最終決着!\"},{\"title\":\"Thank You\",\"number\":342,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-04\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Returning to the World of the Living, Ichigo spends his days hunting down Hollows with what little Spirit Energy he has left. However, knowing that Ichigo cannot continue this much longer, Rukia soon realizes the time of their parting is fast approaching.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"ありがとう\"},{\"title\":\"3rd Year High School Student! Dressed up, and a New Chapter Begins!\",\"number\":343,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-11\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A year has passed since Ichigo lost his Soul Reaper powers, becoming a normal teenager. Now in his final year of high school, Ichigo lives an ordinary life surrounded by his family and friends. Despite finally getting the life he always wanted, Ichigo still feels as if something is lacking, when a mysterious man appears before him.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"高校3年生! 装い新たに新章開始!\"},{\"title\":\"A Dispute in School?! Ichigo and Uryuu, Fight Together!\",\"number\":344,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-18\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Uryu deal with delinquents from another school that come looking for trouble. Following the incident, Ichigo’s boss Unagiya shows up and drags Ichigo back to the office, where he meets a man called Kugo Ginjo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"学校間抗争!? 一護と雨竜, 共闘!\"},{\"title\":\"Uryu is Attacked, A Threat Draws Near the Friends!\",\"number\":345,\"airDate\":\"2011-10-25\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu is rushed to the hospital after being cut down by an unknown attacker. As Ichigo becomes frustrated over not being able to do anything when his friend was attacked, he learns that Keigo and Mizuro have disappeared.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"襲われた雨竜, 仲間達に迫る脅威!\"},{\"title\":\"The Fullbring User: Ginjou Kuugo\",\"number\":346,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Unable to bear seeing his friends get attacked, Ichigo decides to call on Ginjo for some answers. At his hideout, “Xcution,” Ginjo tells Ichigo of his goal to restore Ichigo’s lost Soul Reaper powers, as well as demonstrating his own unique power, “Fullbring.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"完現術(フルブリング)の能力者·銀城空吾\"},{\"title\":\"A Creeping Danger in the Kurosaki Family?! Ichigo`s Confusion!\",\"number\":347,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-08\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ginjo gives Ichigo a day to decide whether to regain his lost Soul Reaper powers or not. But Ichigo, who no longer wishes to endanger anyone by being a Soul Reaper, decides to decline the offer.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"黒崎家に忍び寄る危機!? 一護の迷い!\"},{\"title\":\"Power of the Substitute Badge, Ichigo`s \\\"Pride\\\"!\",\"number\":348,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo begins training to regain his Soul Reaper powers at the Xcution’s hideout. His first training is to fight and win against Mr. Pork, an opponent created by Riruka’s Fullbring power “Dollhouse.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"代行証の力, 一護の\\\"誇り\\\"\"},{\"title\":\"Next Target, The Devil`s Hand Aims at Orihime!\",\"number\":349,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On her way home from school, Orihime is suddenly stopped and asked to die by a man named Shishigawara. Confused at first, Orihime quickly realizes that Shishigawara may be related to Uryu’s attacker, and prepares to fight.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"次の標的, 織姫を狙う魔の手\"},{\"title\":\"The Man Who Killed the Shinigami Substitute?! Tsukishima Makes His Move\",\"number\":350,\"airDate\":\"2011-11-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Chad rush to find Orihime, who they believe may be in danger. Meanwhile, Orihime attempts to stop Tsukishima from leaving the scene, but is instead stabbed by his Fullbring power, “Book of The End.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神代行を殺した男!?動き出す月島\"},{\"title\":\"Fullbring, The Detested Power!\",\"number\":351,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo asks Ginjo to let him fight one of the Xcution members for his training. But Jackie, who detests the power of Fullbring, finds Ichigo’s request selfish and refuses. Meanwhile, danger closes in on Chad.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"フルブリング, 忌み嫌われた力\"},{\"title\":\"Tsukishima Attacks! The Training Has Been Thwarted\",\"number\":352,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo begins his training with Jackie Tristan, who brings out her Fullbring power “Dirty Boots.” As he goes up against Jackie’s powerful attacks, Ichigo begins to gradually understand the use of his own Fullbring power.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"月島, 強襲! 妨害された修行\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo, Mastering the Fullbring!\",\"number\":353,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Tsukishima breaks into the Xcution hideout where Ichigo is training. Learning that he was the one who attacked Uryu and Orihime, a furious Ichigo proceeds to attack Tsukishima. But with his Fullbring power still incomplete, Ichigo finds himself gradually overpowered by his opponent.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"護, 完現術を使いこなせ!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo vs. Ginjou! To the Game`s Space\",\"number\":354,\"airDate\":\"2011-12-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu asks Orihime to heal his injuries after sensing that his assailant has now made contact with Ichigo. Meanwhile, Ichigo enters his training with Ginjo inside Yukio’s Fulbring power “Invaders Must Die.”\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"護vs銀城, ゲームの空間へ\"},{\"title\":\"The Shinigami Enter Battle! Seireitei Also Has a New Year Special!\",\"number\":355,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"On New Year’s Day, Izuru hosts a kite-flying contest in the hopes of everyone having a good time. Meanwhile, Rukia is practicing a dance she will perform for the New Year’s Celebration Ceremony but cannot seem to get the steps right.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"死神参戦! 瀞霊廷もお正月SP!\"},{\"title\":\"Foe or Friend?! Ginjou`s Unseen Heart!\",\"number\":356,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo, with Orihime standing by as his healer, enters his training with Ginjo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"敵か味方か!? 銀城の見えない心!\"},{\"title\":\"Creeping Menace... Tsukishima`s Ability!\",\"number\":357,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Orihime and Chad exchange what information they have about Tsukishima to figure out what he has done to the both of them.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"忍び寄る脅威... 月島の能力!\"},{\"title\":\"Clash?! Xcution Attacks Ginjou\",\"number\":358,\"airDate\":\"2012-01-31\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Uryu begins his own investigation to track down the enemy who attacked him. As he goes around searching for clues, he notices that people close to Ichigo are acting strangely. Meanwhile, Ichigo’s Fullbring training is nearing its completion.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激突!? 銀城を襲うXCUTION\"},{\"title\":\"The Sorrowful Battle! Ichigo vs. Sado & Orihime!\",\"number\":359,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-07\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo escapes from his house in confusion after witnessing his friends and family welcoming Tsukishima as if they’ve known him for years. Regrouping with Ginjo, Ichigo learns that the same change has also happened to Riruka and the other Xcution members.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"哀しみの戦い! 一護VS茶渡 & 織姫!\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo vs. Uryuu?! Who is the Traitor?!\",\"number\":360,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo is shocked to learn that Chad and Orihime have now sided with Tsukishima and are even willing to fight Ichigo to protect their precious “friend.” Meanwhile, Ginjo races to help Ichigo, but the remaining members of Xcution halt his attempt.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護VS雨竜!? 裏切り者は誰だ!\"},{\"title\":\"A New Appearance! Meet the Gotei 13!\",\"number\":361,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ginjo reveals his true colors by attacking Ichigo and stripping him of his Fullbring powers. Ichigo lies in despair from losing his powers yet again, when his father Isshin and Kisuke Urahara arrive.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"新たな姿! 護廷十三隊, 見参!\"},{\"title\":\"Revival! Substitute Shinigami - Ichigo Kurosaki!\",\"number\":362,\"airDate\":\"2012-02-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Under the orders of Head Captain Yamamoto, the 13 Court Guard Squad Soul Reapers share their Spirit Energy to restore Ichigo’s lost powers. With his Soul Reaper powers fully restored, Ichigo returns to challenge Ginjo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"復活! 死神代行·黒崎一護!\"},{\"title\":\"Fierce Fight! Shinigami vs. XCUTION!\",\"number\":363,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Soul Reapers take on the Xcution members in one-on-one battles. Meanwhile, Ichigo and Uryu prepare to take on Ginjo.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"激闘! 死神vsXCUTION!\"},{\"title\":\"Desperate Struggle!? Byakuya`s Troubled Memories\",\"number\":364,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between Byakuya and Tsukishima escalates as they both push their powers to the limit. Meanwhile, Rukia struggles against the cute traps set up by Riruka.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"絶体絶命!? 記憶を挟まれた白哉\"},{\"title\":\"Ichigo vs. Ginjou! The Secret of the Substitute Badge\",\"number\":365,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While facing each other in battle, Uryu notices that Ginjo’s attack contains the presence of Ichigo’s Spirit Energy. Ignoring Uryu’s warning, Ichigo fires his Getsugatensho attack, only to be countered by Ginjo’s own Getsugatensho attack.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"一護VS銀城! 代行証の秘密\"},{\"title\":\"Changing History, Unchanging Heart\",\"number\":366,\"airDate\":\"2012-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Ichigo and Ginjo both release their Bankai to settle the score once and for all.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":null,\"titleJapanese\":\"変わりゆく歴史, 変わらぬ心\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}